msgid "Triton-Ascend FAQ"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend FAQ"

msgid "1. 安装与环境配置"
msgstr "1. Installation and Environment Configuration"

msgid "**Q: 如何正确安装 Triton-Ascend？是否支持 pip 直接安装？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to correctly install Triton-Ascend? Does it support direct installation via pip?**"

msgid "A: 可以直接使用pip 安装"
msgstr "A: You can directly install it using pip."

msgid "**Q: 社区 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend 能否同时存在？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can community Triton and Triton-Ascend coexist?**"

msgid "A: triton-ascend 3.2.0 及以下不可以。需要先卸载社区 Triton，再安装 Triton-Ascend。<br> triton-ascend 3.2.1 及以上，Triton-Ascend 通过将 Triton 声明为安装依赖来缓解安装覆盖问题。 安装 Triton-Ascend 时会先安装社区 Triton，再由 Triton-Ascend 覆盖同名目录，从而避免后续安装其他依赖 Triton 的软件包时再次安装 Triton 而覆盖 Triton-Ascend。 x86 与 arm 使用不同版本的社区 Triton 安装包的原因是社区从 3.5 版本开始才提供 arm 版本安装包：x86 依赖 triton==3.2.0，arm 依赖 triton==3.5.0。"
msgstr "A: For triton-ascend 3.2.0 and below, it is not possible. You need to uninstall the community Triton first, then install Triton-Ascend.<br> For triton-ascend 3.2.1 and above, Triton-Ascend mitigates the installation overwrite issue by declaring Triton as an installation dependency. When installing Triton-Ascend, the community Triton is installed first, and then Triton-Ascend overwrites the directory with the same name, thereby preventing other packages that depend on Triton from reinstalling Triton and overwriting Triton-Ascend during subsequent installations. The reason x86 and arm use different versions of the community Triton installation package is that the community only started providing arm version installation packages from version 3.5 onwards: x86 depends on triton==3.2.0, while arm depends on triton==3.5.0."

msgid "注：若安装triton-ascend后，在安装依赖triton的三方件或者triton本身，将覆盖掉已安装的 Triton-Ascend 目录。 此时需要先卸载社区 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend，再安装 Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr "Note: If you install triton-ascend and then install a third-party component that depends on triton, or triton itself, it will overwrite the installed Triton-Ascend directory. In this case, you need to uninstall the community Triton and Triton-Ascend first, and then install Triton-Ascend."

msgid "**Q: 能否在非 Ascend 硬件（如 CUDA AMD）上使用 Triton-Ascend？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can Triton-Ascend be used on non-Ascend hardware (such as CUDA AMD)?**"

msgid "A: 不可以，只能在 Ascend NPU 硬件环境使用 Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "A: No, Triton-Ascend can only be used in the Ascend NPU hardware environment."

msgid "2. 精度与数值一致性问题"
msgstr "2. Precision and Numerical Consistency Issues"

msgid "**Q: NPU 运行结果和 PyTorch/CPU/GPU 参考结果不一致，如何排查？**"
msgstr "**Q: The NPU execution results are inconsistent with the PyTorch/CPU/GPU reference results. How to troubleshoot?**"

msgid "A: 用例请参考 [07_accuracy_comparison_example.md](../zh/examples/07_accuracy_comparison_example.md) 调试方法请参考 [解释器模式调试方法](./debug_guide/debugging.md#5-调试方法)"
msgstr "A: For use cases, please refer to [07_accuracy_comparison_example.md](../zh/examples/07_accuracy_comparison_example.md). For debugging methods, please refer to [Interpreter Pattern Debugging Methods](./debug_guide/debugging.md#5-调试方法)."

msgid "3. 错误代码与异常处理"
msgstr "3. Error Codes and Exception Handling"

msgid "**Q: 为什么 kernel 编译时报 MLIRCompilationError？如何定位具体失败的 Pass？**"
msgstr "**Q: Why does kernel compilation report MLIRCompilationError? How to locate the specific failing Pass?**"

msgid "A: 请参考 [编译错误调试方法](./debug_guide/debugging.md#52-编译错误调试方法)"
msgstr "A: Please refer to [Compilation Error Debugging Method](./debug_guide/debugging.md#52-编译错误调试方法)"

msgid "4. 调试与日志"
msgstr "4. Debugging and Logging"

msgid "**Q: 如何开启详细日志输出？TRITON_DEBUG=1 输出在哪？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to enable detailed log output? Where is TRITON_DEBUG=1 output?**"

msgid "A: 可以使用 TRITON_DEBUG=1 获取详细的调试转储文件，请参考 [调试转储文件（Dump Files）](./debug_guide/debugging.md#32-调试转储文件dump-files)"
msgstr "A: You can use `TRITON_DEBUG=1` to obtain detailed debug dump files. Please refer to [Debug Dump Files](./debug_guide/debugging.md#32-调试转储文件dump-files)."

msgid "**Q: 能否在 kernel 中打印中间张量值？tl.device_print 是否可用？**"
msgstr "**Q: Can intermediate tensor values be printed in the kernel? Is tl.device_print available?**"

msgid "A: 可以使用 tl.device_print 打印 kernel 中的张量，请参考 [打印调试方法](debug_guide/debugging.md#51-打印调试方法)"
msgstr "A: You can use `tl.device_print` to print tensors in the kernel. Please refer to [Print Debugging Method](debug_guide/debugging.md#51-print-debugging-method)."

msgid "5. 开发与贡献"
msgstr "5. Development and Contribution"

msgid "**Q: 如何本地构建并测试 Triton-Ascend？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to locally build and test Triton-Ascend?**"

msgid "A: 本地构建和测试方法，请参考 [通过源码安装Triton-Ascend](./installation_guide.md#源码安装)"
msgstr "A: For local build and testing methods, please refer to [Install Triton-Ascend from Source](./installation_guide.md#source-installation)."

msgid "**Q: 提交 PR 需要通过哪些 CI 检查？**"
msgstr "**Q: Which CI checks must be passed to submit a PR?**"

msgid "A: PR 的 CI 检查包括：编码安全与规范检查、开源片段检查、恶意代码检查、编译构建、开发者测试"
msgstr "A: PR's CI checks include: coding security and standards checks, open-source snippet checks, malicious code checks, compilation and build, and developer testing."

msgid "6. 性能调优"
msgstr "6. Performance Tuning"

msgid "**Q: 有没有性能分析工具（profiler）可以使用？**"
msgstr "**Q: Are there any profiling tools available?**"

msgid "A: 有集成性能分析工具（profiler），请参考 [算子性能调优方法](./debug_guide/profiling.md)"
msgstr "A: There is an integrated performance analysis tool (profiler). Please refer to [Operator Performance Tuning Method](./debug_guide/profiling.md)."

msgid "7. UB Overflow 常见问题"
msgstr "7. UB Overflow FAQ"

msgid "**Q: 编译时报 \"UB Overflow\" 错误，如何解决？**"
msgstr "**Q: Compilation reports \"UB Overflow\" error, how to resolve?**"

msgid "A: UB Overflow 是 Triton-Ascend 开发中常见的问题，请参考 [UB Overflow 问题排查指南](./debug_guide/ub_overflow.md) 排查问题。如果不知道如何减小tiling来减少UB占用，可以使用Autotune来自动选择最优配置，Autotune的使用请参考[Triton-Ascend autotune 使用指南](./autotune_guide.md)。 A5上可运行的算子迁移到A2/A3由于UB大小的差异可能导致UB Overflow，如果手动排查不出问题，也可采用Autotune自动选择最优配置。"
msgstr "A: UB Overflow is a common issue in Triton-Ascend development. Please refer to the [UB Overflow Troubleshooting Guide](./debug_guide/ub_overflow.md) to diagnose the problem. If you are unsure how to reduce tiling to decrease UB usage, you can use Autotune to automatically select the optimal configuration. For instructions on using Autotune, please refer to the [Triton-Ascend Autotune Guide](./autotune_guide.md). Operators that run on A5 may cause UB Overflow when migrated to A2/A3 due to differences in UB size. If manual troubleshooting fails, Autotune can also be used to automatically select the optimal configuration."

msgid "8. Triton 使用限制"
msgstr "8. Triton Usage Limitations"

msgid "**Q: Triton Kernel 中指针参数有哪些使用限制？**"
msgstr "**Q: What are the usage restrictions for pointer parameters in Triton Kernel?**"

msgid "A: Triton-Ascend 编译期假设所有外部输入的指针参数本质上指向不同的内存区域，无法识别指针别名（Pointer Alias）场景。当多个指针参数在运行时实际指向同一块内存，但编译期无法获知这一事实时，可能导致优化失效或运行结果异常。例如："
msgstr "A: Triton-Ascend assumes during compilation that all externally input pointer parameters essentially point to different memory regions and cannot recognize pointer alias scenarios. When multiple pointer parameters actually point to the same memory block at runtime, but the compiler cannot be aware of this fact, it may lead to optimization failures or abnormal runtime results. For example:"

msgid "上述代码中 `ptr0` 和 `ptr1` 实际指向同一块内存（即同一个 `in_out_tensor`），但编译期无法识别这种指针别名关系，因此这种同一个张量同时作为多个指针参数传入的写法是不受支持的，对应的 Kernel 将无法使能相关优化。"
msgstr "In the above code, `ptr0` and `ptr1` actually point to the same memory (i.e., the same `in_out_tensor`), but the compiler cannot recognize this pointer aliasing relationship. Therefore, writing where the same tensor is passed as multiple pointer arguments is not supported, and the corresponding Kernel will not be able to enable related optimizations."

msgid "**Q: 在 `if` / `for` / `while` / `scope` 等控制流OP中使用 `tl.load` / `tl.store` 有哪些限制？**"
msgstr "**Q: What are the limitations of using `tl.load` / `tl.store` in control flow OPs such as `if` / `for` / `while` / `scope`?**"

msgid "A: Triton-Ascend 支持同一来源 pointer 在控制流中进行简单地址更新后访存，`tl.load` / `tl.store` 放在控制流内部也是合理写法。 但不建议让不同来源或不同结构的 pointer 在控制流后合并，再统一执行访存；也不建议在复杂嵌套控制流中反复更新 pointer 状态并同时执行 store/read-after-write。"
msgstr "A: Triton-Ascend supports memory access after simple address updates of pointers from the same source within control flow. Placing `tl.load` / `tl.store` inside control flow is also a reasonable practice. However, it is not recommended to merge pointers from different sources or with different structures after control flow and then perform unified memory access; nor is it advisable to repeatedly update pointer states and simultaneously execute store/read-after-write operations in complex nested control flow."

msgid "当前版本对于 `if` / `for` / `while` / `scope` 与 `tl.load` / `tl.store` 组合使用的场景支持还不完备，后续版本会持续完善。当前建议遵循以下限制。"
msgstr "The current version does not fully support scenarios where `if` / `for` / `while` / `scope` are used in combination with `tl.load` / `tl.store`, and subsequent versions will continue to improve this. For now, it is recommended to follow the restrictions below."

msgid "不推荐让不同基地址的 pointer，或在不同分支中分别构造的 block pointer，在分支后合并再访存："
msgstr "It is not recommended to merge pointers with different base addresses, or block pointers constructed in different branches, after branching and then perform memory access."

msgid "推荐把访存放在各自分支中，让分支合并 loaded value，而不是 pointer 或 block pointer："
msgstr "It is recommended to store the visits in their respective branches, allowing branches to merge loaded values rather than pointers or block pointers."

msgid "架构设计与核心特性"
msgstr "Architecture Design and Core Features"

msgid "1.逻辑架构"
msgstr "1. Logical Architecture"

msgid "![图像](./figures/architectural_diagram.png) **Triton-Ascend 架构说明**"
msgstr "![Image](./figures/architectural_diagram.png) **Triton-Ascend Architecture Description**"

msgid "图像"
msgstr "Image"

msgid "**核心组件：**"
msgstr "**Core Components:**"

msgid "**`Ascend language extension`**：适配 Ascend 的 Triton 语言扩展"
msgstr "**`Ascend language extension`**: Triton language extension adapted for Ascend"

msgid "**`compiler`**：适配 Ascend 的 Triton 编译器"
msgstr "**`compiler`**: Triton compiler adapted for Ascend"

msgid "**`driver`**：适配 Ascend 的设备驱动接口"
msgstr "**`driver`**: Device driver interface for Ascend"

msgid "**组件功能：**"
msgstr "**Component Function:**"

msgid "**`Ascend language extension`** 在标准 Triton 语言基础上，引入针对 Ascend NPU 架构的语法与语义扩展。"
msgstr "**`Ascend language extension`** introduces syntax and semantic extensions for the Ascend NPU architecture based on the standard Triton language."

msgid "**`compiler`** 接收来自上层 Triton compiler 生成的中间表示文件 `TTIR`（Triton IR），执行一系列适配昇腾硬件的转换。"
msgstr "**`compiler`** receives the intermediate representation file `TTIR` (Triton IR) generated by the upper-level Triton compiler and performs a series of transformations adapted to Ascend hardware."

msgid "Triton IR 转换为 Linalg IR，再经 BiSheng Compiler 生成面向 Ascend NPU 的可执行二进制文件  `triton_xxx_kernel.o`。"
msgstr "Triton IR is converted to Linalg IR, and then through the BiSheng Compiler, an executable binary file `triton_xxx_kernel.o` targeting the Ascend NPU is generated."

msgid "**`driver`** 提供 Triton 运行时与 Ascend 软件栈（CANN）之间的对接能力， 加载由 BiSheng Compiler 生成的设备侧可执行内核 `triton_xxx_kernel.o` 。"
msgstr "**`driver`** provides the integration capability between the Triton runtime and the Ascend software stack (CANN), loading the device-side executable kernel `triton_xxx_kernel.o` generated by the BiSheng Compiler."

msgid "2.代码结构"
msgstr "2. Code Structure"

msgid "2.1 代码结构原则"
msgstr "2.1 Principles of Code Structure"

msgid "本项目在标准 Triton 基础上，扩展支持华为 Ascend NPU（通过 CANN 软件栈）。整体设计遵循以下**代码原则**："
msgstr "This project extends support for Huawei Ascend NPU (via the CANN software stack) based on standard Triton. The overall design follows the following **code principles**:"

msgid "**若修改与目标硬件无关**（target independent），应保留在 **Triton core** 部分（如language、runtime的通用修改）；"
msgstr "**If the modification is target independent**, it should be kept in the **Triton core** section (e.g., general modifications to language, runtime);"

msgid "**若修改与 Ascend 硬件强相关**（target affinitive），应放在 **Triton-Ascend** 中。"
msgstr "**If modifications are strongly related to Ascend hardware** (target affinitive), they should be placed in **Triton-Ascend**."

msgid "2.2 目录结构与功能说明"
msgstr "2.2 Directory Structure and Functional Description"

msgid "目录或文件"
msgstr "Directory or file"

msgid "对应架构层级"
msgstr "Corresponding architecture level"

msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Function Description"

msgid "`python/`"
msgstr "`python/`"

msgid "Triton core"
msgstr "Triton core"

msgid "保留标准 Triton 的 Python 侧通用实现，包括 `triton.language`、JIT、运行时、缓存、工具链入口等。与硬件无关的通用能力优先放在该目录。"
msgstr "Retain the standard Triton Python-side general implementation, including `triton.language`, JIT, runtime, caching, toolchain entry points, etc. Hardware-independent general capabilities should be prioritized in this directory."

msgid "`include/` 和 `lib/`"
msgstr "`include/` and `lib/`"

msgid "保留标准 Triton 的通用 C++/MLIR 基础设施、Dialect、Pass 和转换逻辑。这里不承载 Ascend 专属后端实现。"
msgstr "Retain the standard Triton's general C++/MLIR infrastructure, Dialect, Pass, and conversion logic. This does not carry Ascend-specific backend implementations."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/`"

msgid "Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend"

msgid "Ascend 后端的根目录，集中放置与 Ascend NPU、CANN、BiSheng Compiler 强相关的语言扩展、编译后端、运行时驱动、MLIR Pass、示例和测试。"
msgstr "Ascend backend root directory, centrally housing language extensions, compilation backends, runtime drivers, MLIR passes, examples, and tests that are strongly related to Ascend NPU, CANN, and BiSheng Compiler."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/language/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/language/`"

msgid "Ascend language extension"
msgstr "Ascend language extension"

msgid "Ascend 语言扩展目录，安装后会链接到 `triton.language.extra` 下，供 Triton kernel 通过 `triton.language.extra.cann` 使用。"
msgstr "Ascend language extension directory, which will be linked under `triton.language.extra` after installation, for use by Triton kernels via `triton.language.extra.cann`."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/language/cann/libdevice.py`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/language/cann/libdevice.py`"

msgid "适配 Ascend NPU 的 `libdevice` Python 接口，提供数学函数和底层算子封装，供 Triton 算子调用。"
msgstr "`libdevice` Python interface adapted for Ascend NPU, providing mathematical functions and low-level operator encapsulation for Triton operator invocation."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/backend/compiler.py`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/backend/compiler.py`"

msgid "compiler"
msgstr "compiler"

msgid "Ascend 编译器后端主入口，负责注册编译选项、组织 TTIR 到 Ascend 适配 IR、Linalg/LLVM 等阶段的转换，并调用后续工具链生成可执行二进制文件。"
msgstr "The main entry of the Ascend compiler backend is responsible for registering compilation options, organizing the conversion from TTIR to Ascend adaptation IR, Linalg/LLVM, and other stages, and invoking the subsequent toolchain to generate executable binary files."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/backend/driver.py`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/backend/driver.py`"

msgid "driver"
msgstr "driver"

msgid "Ascend 运行时驱动模块，负责与 CANN/TorchNPU 等运行时环境对接，加载并启动已编译的设备侧可执行文件。"
msgstr "Ascend runtime driver module, responsible for interfacing with runtime environments such as CANN/TorchNPU, loading and launching compiled device-side executable files."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/include/` 和 `third_party/ascend/lib/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/include/` and `third_party/ascend/lib/`"

msgid "Ascend 专属 MLIR Dialect、Pass 和转换实现，例如 `TritonToLinalg`、`TritonToStructured`、`DynamicCVPipeline`、`AutoBlockify` 等。"
msgstr "Ascend-specific MLIR Dialect, Pass, and conversion implementations, such as `TritonToLinalg`, `TritonToStructured`, `DynamicCVPipeline`, `AutoBlockify`, etc."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/AscendNPU-IR/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/AscendNPU-IR/`"

msgid "Ascend NPU 相关 IR 与 BiSheng 编译链适配内容，是从 Triton-Ascend 编译流程继续下沉到硬件侧代码生成的重要组成部分。"
msgstr "The adaptation content between Ascend NPU-related IR and the BiSheng compilation chain is an important component that further sinks from the Triton-Ascend compilation flow into hardware-side code generation."

msgid "`third_party/ascend/tutorials/` 和 `third_party/ascend/unittest/`"
msgstr "`third_party/ascend/tutorials/` and `third_party/ascend/unittest/`"

msgid "示例与测试"
msgstr "Examples and Tests"

msgid "提供 Ascend 平台上的 Triton 示例、迁移样例、Python 单元测试和 MLIR 转换测试，用于验证 Ascend 后端能力。"
msgstr "Provides Triton examples, migration samples, Python unit tests, and MLIR conversion tests on the Ascend platform to verify Ascend backend capabilities."

