msgid "技术例会"
msgstr "Technical regular meeting"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 定期召开社区技术会议，作为项目治理的核心决策机制。技术方向、重大提案评审和版本发布等重大事项在技术会议中讨论和决定，由全体 `Maintainer` 投票。会议对所有社区成员开放，任何人均可参与讨论，但决策和投票仅由 `Maintainer` 进行。"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend holds regular community technical meetings as the core decision-making mechanism for project governance. Major matters such as technical direction, major proposal reviews, and version releases are discussed and decided in technical meetings, with voting conducted by all `Maintainer`s. The meetings are open to all community members, and anyone can participate in discussions, but decisions and voting are carried out only by `Maintainer`s."

msgid "会议内容"
msgstr "Meeting content"

msgid "技术方向讨论与决策"
msgstr "Technical direction discussion and decision-making"

msgid "重大提案（RFC）评审与投票"
msgstr "Major Proposal (RFC) Review and Voting"

msgid "版本发布规划与时间线"
msgstr "Version Release Planning and Timeline"

msgid "社区 Issue 和 PR 优先级排序"
msgstr "Community Issue and PR Priority Sorting"

msgid "贡献者提名与移除讨论"
