msgid "`torch.testing.assert_close`/`torch.equal` 不抛出异常 → **通过**，否则 **不通过**。"
msgstr "`torch.testing.assert_close`/`torch.equal` does not raise an exception → **Pass**, otherwise **Fail**."

msgid "`torch.testing.assert_close`：如果张量在指定的容差范围内近似相等，则通过（不抛出异常）；否则不通过（抛出 AssertionError）。"
msgstr "`torch.testing.assert_close`: Passes (does not raise an exception) if the tensors are approximately equal within the specified tolerances; otherwise fails (raises an AssertionError)."

msgid "`torch.equal`：要求两个张量具有完全相同的形状，且所有元素在二进制级别上绝对相等，才返回 True，否则返回 False。"
msgstr "`torch.equal`: Returns True if two tensors have exactly the same shape and all elements are absolutely equal at the binary level; otherwise, returns False."

