msgid "仿真流水图采集Triton算子Debug版本"
msgstr "Simulation pipeline collects Triton operator Debug version"

msgid "仿真流水图（trace.json / visualize_data.bin）默认只包含指令地址与指令名。若希望在MindStudio Insight中使用指令关联看板、查看指令对应的Triton/Python源码行与调用栈（即[查找瓶颈](#查找瓶颈)中的方法四），需要将算子编译为带debug_line调试信息的版本。未开启时，msprof op simulator会输出如下提示，且代码关联文件为空："
msgstr "The simulation trace (trace.json / visualize_data.bin) by default only contains instruction addresses and instruction names. To use the instruction correlation dashboard in MindStudio Insight and view the Triton/Python source lines and call stacks corresponding to the instructions (i.e., Method 4 in [Finding Bottlenecks](#finding-bottlenecks)), the operator must be compiled with debug_line debugging information. When not enabled, msprof op simulator will output the following prompt, and the code correlation file will be empty:"

msgid "Triton算子无需手动添加`-g`，triton-ascend后端通过环境变量`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`控制是否在`bishengir-compile`命令中追加`--enable-debug-info=true`。注意triton-ascend默认值为`true`（即默认**关闭**行号信息，与社区Triton默认开启相反），需显式置为`False`："
msgstr "Triton operators do not require manually adding `-g`. The triton-ascend backend controls whether to append `--enable-debug-info=true` to the `bishengir-compile` command via the environment variable `TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`. Note that the default value of triton-ascend is `true` (i.e., line number information is **disabled** by default, contrary to the community Triton default which is enabled), and it needs to be explicitly set to `False`."

msgid "验证是否生效：日志中`[DEBUG] cmd_list:`一行应包含`--enable-debug-info=true`，且`Kernel missed debug_line information`告警消失。随后将`visualize_data.bin`导入MindStudio Insight，即可在指令时序图中查看每条指令关联的源码行与调用栈。"
msgstr "Verify if it takes effect: The line `[DEBUG] cmd_list:` in the log should contain `--enable-debug-info=true`, and the `Kernel missed debug_line information` warning should disappear. Then import `visualize_data.bin` into MindStudio Insight to view the source code line and call stack associated with each instruction in the instruction timing diagram."

msgid "分析性能数据"
msgstr "Analyze performance data"

msgid "理论参数"
msgstr "Theoretical parameters"

msgid "理论性能为算子实际性能的理想目标。不同的硬件平台的硬件规格各异，理论性能可以帮助我们了解硬件的潜能，从而设定性能优化的目标。"
msgstr "Theoretical performance represents the ideal target for the actual performance of an operator. Different hardware platforms have varying hardware specifications, and theoretical performance can help us understand the potential of the hardware, thereby setting performance optimization goals."

msgid "搬运相关流水（MTE1/MTE2/MTE3等）的理论耗时 = 搬运数据量（单位：Byte）/ 理论带宽。例如：某款AI处理器的GM峰值带宽约为1.8TB/s，想要进行一次float数据类型、4096 * 4096大小的矩阵搬运，搬运的理论耗时是`sizeof(float) * 4096 * 4096 / 1.8 TB/s = 37.28 us`（按照1 TB = 10<sup>12</sup> Byte来计算）。"
msgstr "The theoretical time for data movement-related streams (MTE1/MTE2/MTE3, etc.) = data movement volume (unit: Byte) / theoretical bandwidth. For example: the GM peak bandwidth of a certain AI processor is approximately 1.8 TB/s. To move a matrix of float data type with a size of 4096 * 4096, the theoretical time for the movement is `sizeof(float) * 4096 * 4096 / 1.8 TB/s = 37.28 us` (calculated based on 1 TB = 10<sup>12</sup> Byte)."

msgid "说明:"
msgstr "Description:"

msgid "搬运指令同时存在时，会存在共享带宽的情况，并不能每条都以接近理论带宽的速率搬运数据。比如，当MTE2/MTE3同时进行GM读写时，搬运流水线的耗时应该是（MTE2搬运量 + MTE3搬运量）/ GM带宽。"
msgstr "When multiple copy instructions exist simultaneously, bandwidth is shared, and not every instruction can transfer data at a rate close to the theoretical bandwidth. For example, when MTE2 and MTE3 perform GM read/write operations at the same time, the time consumed by the copy pipeline should be (MTE2 transfer volume + MTE3 transfer volume) / GM bandwidth."

msgid "搬运不同大小的数据块时，对带宽的利用率（有效带宽/理论带宽）不一样。针对每次搬运数据量较小的情况，实测性能达不到理论带宽。"
msgstr "When moving data blocks of different sizes, the bandwidth utilization (effective bandwidth / theoretical bandwidth) varies. For cases where the amount of data moved per operation is small, the measured performance does not reach the theoretical bandwidth."

msgid "计算相关流水（Cube/Vector/Scalar等）的理论耗时 = 计算数据量（单位：Element） / 理论算力。例如：某款AI处理器对float数据类型的Vector理论峰值算力为11.06 TOPS，想要进行一次32K float类型的Element单指令计算，计算的理论耗时是32K / 11.06TOPS = 0.003us （按照1K =1000来计算）。"
msgstr "The theoretical time consumption for computation-related pipelines (Cube/Vector/Scalar, etc.) = computation data volume (unit: Element) / theoretical computing power. For example: the theoretical peak computing power of a certain AI processor for Vector operations on float data type is 11.06 TOPS. To perform a single instruction computation on 32K float-type Elements, the theoretical time consumption is 32K / 11.06TOPS = 0.003us (calculated with 1K = 1000)."

msgid "查找瓶颈"
msgstr "Find the bottleneck"

msgid "获取性能数据后，和理论数值差异较大的地方、耗时较长的流程被认为是“瓶颈点”。下文将介绍如何通过性能数据找到瓶颈点和对应的优化方向。"
msgstr "After obtaining performance data, areas with significant deviations from theoretical values and processes with long durations are considered \"bottlenecks.\" The following will introduce how to identify bottlenecks and corresponding optimization directions through performance data."

msgid "方法一：通过上板Profiling分析流水情况 查看上板Profiling解析后的op_summary_\\*.csv文件分析流水情况。注：“\\*”表示时间戳。 ![analyse_data_op_summary](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_op_summary.png)"
msgstr "Method 1: Analyze pipeline status through on-board profiling. Check the op_summary_*.csv file after on-board profiling parsing to analyze pipeline status. Note: \"*\" represents a timestamp. ![analyse_data_op_summary](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_op_summary.png)"

msgid "analyse_data_op_summary"
msgstr "analyse_data_op_summary"

msgid "每条流水线的利用率理想情况下应为100%，没有达到100%的流水就可能有提升空间。上图示例中为某款AI处理器上获取的数据，可以看到Vector算子_layer_norm_fwd_fused的第一个场景中，Vector流水的利用率aiv_vec_ratio小于10%，判断未充分发挥算力；Scalar流水的利用率aiv_scalar_ratio已经在60%左右，判断Scalar是最长的流水。   当Scalar是最长的流水时：需要分析算子源码中是否对标量值进行复杂的运算，昇腾的SIMD微架构更适合多数据并行计算；另一种可能性是，由于一部分指令在硬件上不支持特定的数据类型，Triton软件栈将向量计算退化为标量计算。需要结合流水和标量优化手段进行优化，可参考方法三、查看仿真流水图，以及方法四、查看代码热点的情况进一步分析。   对于更一般的情况，例如MTE2搬运和实际的场景：三个输入矩阵的shape分别为(128,128)、(128,1)、(128,1)，数据类型为float16。当前算法为Two-pass方法，因此有三次X的搬入，以及W、B的各一次搬入，由此可以计算出总共需要搬运的数据量，继而通过[理论参数](#理论参数)中介绍的搬运流水理论耗时计算方法计算出理论值为 `sizeof(float16) * (128 * 128 * 3 + 128 + 128) / 1.8 TB/s ≈ 0.1991 us`（按照1 TB = $10^{12}$ Byte来计算），与实际性能数据aiv_mte2_time存在比较大的差距。经分析，输入数据的总大小小于UB的空间（A2型号为192KB）。因此MTE2时间过长可能是Tiling计算得到的基本块太小，导致发射冗余的搬运指令。需要结合流水优化和Tiling优化手段进行优化。可参考方法三，查看仿真流水图，进一步分析各条流水的情况。"
msgstr "Ideally, the utilization rate of each pipeline should be 100%. Any pipeline that does not reach 100% may have room for improvement. In the example above, data obtained from a certain AI processor shows that in the first scenario of the Vector operator `_layer_norm_fwd_fused`, the Vector pipeline utilization rate `aiv_vec_ratio` is less than 10%, indicating that the compute power is not fully utilized; the Scalar pipeline utilization rate `aiv_scalar_ratio` is already around 60%, suggesting that Scalar is the longest pipeline. When Scalar is the longest pipeline: it is necessary to analyze whether the operator source code involves complex operations on scalar values. The Ascend SIMD microarchitecture is more suitable for multi-data parallel computation. Another possibility is that, due to some instructions not supporting specific data types in hardware, the Triton software stack degrades vector computation to scalar computation. Optimization should be performed by combining pipeline and scalar optimization methods. Refer to Method 3, viewing the simulation pipeline diagram, and Method 4, checking code hotspots for further analysis. For more general cases, such as MTE2 data movement and actual scenarios: the shapes of the three input matrices are (128,128), (128,1), and (128,1), with a data type of float16. The current algorithm uses the Two-pass method, so there are three loads of X and one load each of W and B. From this, the total amount of data to be moved can be calculated. Then, using the theoretical calculation method for data movement pipeline time introduced in [Theoretical Parameters](#theoretical parameters), the theoretical value is `sizeof(float16) * (128 * 128 * 3 + 128 + 128) / 1.8 TB/s ≈ 0.1991 us` (calculated with 1 TB = $10^{12}$ Bytes). There is a significant gap compared to the actual performance data `aiv_mte2_time`. Analysis shows that the total size of the input data is smaller than the UB space (192KB for the A2 model). Therefore, the excessively long MTE2 time may be due to the basic blocks calculated by Tiling being too small, resulting in redundant data movement instructions. Optimization should be performed by combining pipeline optimization and Tiling optimization methods. Refer to Method 3, viewing the simulation pipeline diagram, to further analyze the status of each pipeline."

msgid "方法二：通过上板Profiling分析Tiling情况 先前示例中使用的AI处理器，可以通过硬件平台查看到有48个Vector核，_layer_norm_fwd_fused算子是一个纯Vector算子，但是有些场景下发了过多的Block（Block Dim > 48），造成Host调度开销过大。那么下一步的主要优化方向为Tiling优化。"
msgstr "Method 2: Analyze Tiling through On-Board Profiling. The AI processor used in the previous example can be observed via the hardware platform to have 48 Vector cores. The _layer_norm_fwd_fused operator is a pure Vector operator, but in some scenarios, too many Blocks are issued (Block Dim > 48), resulting in excessive Host scheduling overhead. Therefore, the next main optimization direction is Tiling optimization."

msgid "方法三：通过仿真流水图分析流水情况 ![analyse_data_waveform](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_waveform.png)   上图示例中为某款AI处理器仿真器上获取的数据，可以看到Vector核的SCALAR以及FLOWCTRL的指令饱和，可以结合算子逻辑分析，是否存在过多标量计算以及不支持的向量化操作。下一步的主要优化方向为标量计算优化。另一方面，可以看到Vector核的相关流水（veccore0的MTE2、VECTOR等）有规律性的断流现象，即大量无操作的空白段。可以结合算子逻辑分析，是否存在基本块切分过小等因素导致断流。主要优化方向为流水优化，其次结合Tiling优化和内存优化等手段进一步提升Vector流水利用率。"
msgstr "Method 3: Analyze pipeline status through simulation waveform ![analyse_data_waveform](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_waveform.png) In the example above, data obtained from a certain AI processor simulator shows that the SCALAR and FLOWCTRL instructions of the Vector core are saturated. Combined with operator logic analysis, it can be determined whether there are excessive scalar computations and unsupported vectorization operations. The next main optimization direction is scalar computation optimization. On the other hand, it can be observed that the relevant pipelines of the Vector core (such as MTE2 and VECTOR of veccore0) exhibit periodic pipeline stalls, i.e., a large number of blank segments with no operations. Combined with operator logic analysis, it can be determined whether factors such as overly small basic block partitioning cause the stalls. The main optimization direction is pipeline optimization, followed by Tiling optimization and memory optimization to further improve Vector pipeline utilization."

msgid "analyse_data_waveform"
msgstr "analyse_data_waveform"

msgid "方法四：通过代码热点分析情况 ![analyse_data_code_mapping](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_code_mapping.png)   上图示例中为某款AI处理器仿真器上获取的数据，可以看到左侧load接口对应到右侧的一组汇编指令中（已筛选仅显示代码行相关指令，并按运行拍数降序排序），标量指令占比高，不符合load作为访存接口应该MTE占比高的情况。因此主要优化方向为标量计算。"
msgstr "Method 4: Analyzing the Situation Through Code Hotspots ![analyse_data_code_mapping](../figures/performance_analysis_analyse_data_code_mapping.png) In the example above, the data is obtained from a certain AI processor simulator. It can be seen that the load interface on the left corresponds to a set of assembly instructions on the right (filtered to display only code-line-related instructions, sorted in descending order by execution cycles). The proportion of scalar instructions is high, which does not match the expected scenario where load, as a memory access interface, should have a high proportion of MTE. Therefore, the main optimization direction is scalar computation."

msgid "analyse_data_code_mapping"
msgstr "analyse_data_code_mapping"

msgid "示例：i64/i32 的compare在npu上无法启用vector导致向量计算转为标量计算"
msgstr "Example: The compare operation for i64/i32 cannot enable vectorization on the NPU, causing vector computation to be converted to scalar computation."

msgid "【描述】i64/i32 的cmp在npu上无法启用vector，退化为scalar计算效率降低；通过转化为fp32来利用vec_cast和vec_cmp实现vector操作加速。 【注意】在tl.load和tl.save中的mask使用cmp功能，大部分情况下编译器可以自动优化为vec操作，本例中tl.where则需要手动转换。"
msgstr "[Description] The cmp of i64/i32 cannot enable vector on NPU, degrading to scalar computation with reduced efficiency; by converting to fp32, vec_cast and vec_cmp are utilized to achieve vector operation acceleration. [Note] When using cmp functionality in mask within tl.load and tl.save, the compiler can automatically optimize to vector operations in most cases; in this example, tl.where requires manual conversion."

msgid "**示例图** 优化前后数据对比图 ![图2 optimization2](../figures/optimization.png) 通过分析图中的数据可以发现，优化前后的aiv_scalar_time(us)和aiv_scalar_ratio差距较大，说明性能差的原因是有很多scalar运算， 通过采集[算子仿真流水图](#算子仿真流水图)可以得到visualize_data.bin，再用MindStudio Insight解析visualize_data.bin，可以发现xbar = tl.where(cols < N, x - mean, 0.0)有很多scalar运算，通过上面优化可以减少scalar运算。"
msgstr "**Example Figure** Comparison of data before and after optimization ![Figure 2 optimization2](../figures/optimization.png) By analyzing the data in the figure, it can be found that there is a significant difference in aiv_scalar_time(us) and aiv_scalar_ratio before and after optimization, indicating that the poor performance is caused by a large number of scalar operations. By collecting the [operator simulation pipeline diagram](#operator simulation pipeline diagram), visualize_data.bin can be obtained. Then, using MindStudio Insight to parse visualize_data.bin, it can be discovered that xbar = tl.where(cols < N, x - mean, 0.0) involves many scalar operations. The optimization described above can reduce these scalar operations."

msgid "图2 optimization2"
msgstr "Figure 2 optimization2"

msgid "UB Overflow 问题排查指南"
msgstr "UB Overflow Troubleshooting Guide"

msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

msgid "UB Overflow 是 Triton-Ascend 开发中常见的问题。本文档详细介绍 UB Overflow 的常见原因、解决方案和调试方法。"
msgstr "UB Overflow is a common issue in Triton-Ascend development. This document provides a detailed introduction to the common causes, solutions, and debugging methods for UB Overflow."

msgid "常见原因及解决方案"
msgstr "Common Causes and Solutions"

msgid "1. 使用了会增加 UB 开销的接口参数"
msgstr "Using interface parameters that increase UB overhead."

msgid "某些接口在特定参数配置下会自动添加额外的处理逻辑，导致 UB 空间使用增加："
msgstr "Some interfaces automatically add additional processing logic under specific parameter configurations, leading to increased UB space usage."

msgid "`tl.maximum`、`tl.minimum`、`tl.clamp` 接口的 `propagate_nan` 参数"
msgstr "The `propagate_nan` parameter of the `tl.maximum`, `tl.minimum`, and `tl.clamp` interfaces."

msgid "**问题描述：** 当设置 `propagate_nan=tl.PropagateNAN.NONE` 时，系统会自动添加 NaN 值检测和处理逻辑。"
msgstr "**Problem Description:** When setting `propagate_nan=tl.PropagateNAN.NONE`, the system automatically adds NaN value detection and handling logic."

msgid "**影响：**"
msgstr "**Impact:**"

msgid "显著增加 UB 空间使用"
msgstr "Significantly increase UB space usage"

msgid "可能导致性能下降"
msgstr "May cause performance degradation."

msgid "**解决方案：**"
msgstr "**Solution:**"

msgid "如果输入数据不包含 NaN 值或不需要严格的 NaN 处理语义，考虑调整 `propagate_nan` 参数值"
msgstr "If the input data does not contain NaN values or does not require strict NaN handling semantics, consider adjusting the `propagate_nan` parameter value."

msgid "在 UB 空间紧张的场景下，优先选择不会触发额外 NaN 处理的参数配置"
msgstr "In scenarios where UB space is constrained, prioritize parameter configurations that do not trigger additional NaN handling."

msgid "2. 中间变量过多"
msgstr "2. Too many intermediate variables"

msgid "**问题：** kernel 中定义了大量临时张量或中间计算结果"
msgstr "**Problem:** A large number of temporary tensors or intermediate computation results are defined in the kernel."

msgid "减少不必要的中间变量"
msgstr "Reduce unnecessary intermediate variables."

msgid "复用已分配的缓冲区"
msgstr "Reuse allocated buffers"

msgid "将大计算拆分为多个小 kernel"
msgstr "Split the large computation into multiple small kernels."

msgid "3. shape 过大"
msgstr "3. shape is too large"

msgid "**问题：** 处理高维/大 shape 张量"
msgstr "**Problem:** Handling high-dimensional/large shape tensors"

msgid "考虑将大 tensor 分块处理"
msgstr "Consider processing large tensors in blocks."

msgid "修改分块策略，减小每块的大小"
msgstr "Modify the chunking strategy to reduce the size of each chunk."

msgid "调试建议"
msgstr "Debugging Suggestions"

msgid "**开启详细日志**"
msgstr "**Enable Detailed Logging**"

msgid "使用 `TRITON_DEBUG=1` 查看详细的编译信息"
msgstr "Use `TRITON_DEBUG=1` to view detailed compilation information."

msgid "定位具体哪个算子导致 UB 溢出"
msgstr "Locate which specific operator caused the UB overflow."

msgid "**逐步排查**"
msgstr "**Step-by-step troubleshooting**"

msgid "通过注释掉部分代码，定位导致问题的具体操作"
msgstr "By commenting out parts of the code, locate the specific operation causing the issue."

msgid "**参考文档**"
msgstr "**Reference Documentation**"

msgid "查看各接口文档中的\"特殊限制说明\"部分"
msgstr "Check the \"Special Restrictions\" section in each API documentation."

msgid "了解可能增加 UB 开销的参数配置"
msgstr "Understanding parameter configurations that may increase UB overhead"

msgid "**优化策略**"
msgstr "**Optimization Strategy**"

msgid "优先处理占用 UB 空间较大的算子"
msgstr "Prioritize operators that occupy larger UB space."

msgid "考虑重新设计算法以减少中间变量"
msgstr "Consider redesigning the algorithm to reduce intermediate variables."

msgid "考虑修改分块策略"
msgstr "Consider modifying the chunking strategy."

msgid "环境变量与编译选项"
msgstr "Environment Variables and Compilation Options"

msgid "本文汇总 Triton-Ascend 中可由开发者显式控制的行为开关，包括运行前设置的环境变量，以及编译期通过 `triton.Config` 或 kernel launch meta-parameter 传入的 NPU 编译选项。"
msgstr "This document summarizes the behavior switches in Triton-Ascend that can be explicitly controlled by developers, including environment variables set before runtime, as well as NPU compilation options passed through `triton.Config` or kernel launch meta-parameters during compilation."

msgid "环境变量"
msgstr "Environment variable"

msgid "环境变量用法示例"
msgstr "Environment Variable Usage Example"

msgid "环境变量需在运行 Python 程序前设置，例如："
msgstr "Environment variables need to be set before running the Python program, for example:"

msgid "环境变量参考表"
msgstr "Environment Variable Reference Table"

msgid "环境变量配置参考下表："
msgstr "Environment variable configuration reference table:"

msgid "类别"
msgstr "Category"

msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

msgid "配置说明"
msgstr "Configuration Instructions"

msgid "变更声明"
msgstr "Change Statement"

msgid "**调试与日志**"
msgstr "**Debugging and Logging**"

msgid "TRITON_DEBUG"
msgstr "TRITON_DEBUG"

msgid "0 或未设置"
msgstr "0 or not set"

msgid "启用 Triton 的调试输出功能，用于在运行时打印详细的调试信息。这对于排查编译或执行阶段的问题非常有用。 当设置为 1 时，Triton 会输出更多关于编译过程、内核生成和执行的信息。 某些实现中可能支持更细粒度的调试级别（如 2, 3 等），具体取决于 Triton 的版本和实现。"
msgstr "Enable Triton's debug output to print detailed debugging information at runtime. This is very useful for troubleshooting issues during the compilation or execution phase. When set to 1, Triton outputs more information about the compilation process, kernel generation, and execution. Some implementations may support finer-grained debug levels (such as 2, 3, etc.), depending on the version and implementation of Triton."

msgid "0：不启用DEBUG<br>1：启用DEBUG"
msgstr "0: Disable DEBUG<br>1: Enable DEBUG"

msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP"

msgid "在每次 MLIR 优化前转储所有内核的 IR。使用 `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=kernelName`可以只转储特定内核的IR。"
msgstr "Dump the IR of all kernels before each MLIR optimization. Use `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=kernelName` to dump the IR of a specific kernel only."

msgid "0：不转储<br>1：转储所有内核IR kernelName：转储特定内核IR"
msgstr "0: Do not dump<br>1: Dump all kernel IR<br>kernelName: Dump specific kernel IR"

msgid "Triton 缓存可能干扰转储。如果 `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`  不生效，可尝试清理 Triton 缓存： `rm -r ~/.triton/cache`"
msgstr "Triton cache may interfere with dumping. If `MLIR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` does not take effect, try clearing the Triton cache: `rm -r ~/.triton/cache`"

msgid "LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP"
msgstr "LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP"

msgid "在每次 LLVM IR 优化前转储 IR。"
msgstr "Dump IR before each LLVM IR optimization."

msgid "0：不转储<br>1：转储IR"
msgstr "0: No dump<br>1: Dump IR"

msgid "TRITON_REPRODUCER_PATH"
msgstr "TRITON_REPRODUCER_PATH"

msgid "未设置"
msgstr "Not set"

msgid "在每个 MLIR 编译阶段前生成 MLIR 复现文件。如果某阶段失败，`<reproducer_path>`  将保存失败前的 MLIR 状态。"
msgstr "Generate MLIR reproducer files before each MLIR compilation phase. If a phase fails, `<reproducer_path>` will save the MLIR state before the failure."

msgid "<reproducer_path>：保存路径"
msgstr "<reproducer_path>: Save path"

msgid "TRITON_INTERPRET"
msgstr "TRITON_INTERPRET"

msgid "使用 Triton 解释器而非 GPU 运行，支持在核函数代码中插入 Python 断点"
msgstr "Run with the Triton interpreter instead of the GPU, supporting the insertion of Python breakpoints in kernel function code."

msgid "0：不支持断点<br>1：支持断点"
msgstr "0: Resume not supported<br>1: Resume supported"

msgid "TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG"
msgstr "TRITON_ENABLE_LLVM_DEBUG"

msgid "向LLVM 传递`-debug`参数，输出大量调试信息。若信息过多，可使用`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY`限制输出范围。"
msgstr "Pass the `-debug` parameter to LLVM to output a large amount of debugging information. If there is too much information, use `TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY` to limit the output scope."

msgid "0：不传递<br>1：传递"
msgstr "0: Do not pass<br>1: Pass"

msgid "另一种减少输出干扰的方法是：先设置 `LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP=1`运行程序，提取目标LLVM优化通道前的中间表示（IR），然后单独运行LLVM的`opt`工具，此时可通过命令行添加`-debug-only=foo`参数来限定调试范围。"
msgstr "Another method to reduce output interference is: first set `LLVM_IR_ENABLE_DUMP=1` to run the program, extract the intermediate representation (IR) before the target LLVM optimization pass, then run LLVM's `opt` tool separately, at which point you can limit the debugging scope by adding the `-debug-only=foo` parameter via the command line."

msgid "TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY"
msgstr "TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY"

msgid "功能等同于 LLVM 的`-debug-only`命令行选项。该参数可将 LLVM 调试输出限定到特定的优化通道或组件名称（这些名称通过 LLVM 和 Triton 中的`#define DEBUG_TYPE`宏定义），从而有效减少调试信息的冗余输出。用户可指定一个或多个逗号分隔的值，例如：`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions\"`或`TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions,regalloc\"`。"
msgstr "Functionally equivalent to LLVM's `-debug-only` command-line option. This parameter restricts LLVM debug output to specific optimization passes or component names (defined via the `#define DEBUG_TYPE` macro in LLVM and Triton), effectively reducing redundant debug information output. Users can specify one or more comma-separated values, for example: `TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions\"` or `TRITON_LLVM_DEBUG_ONLY=\"tritongpu-remove-layout-conversions,regalloc\"`."

msgid "逗号分隔值：通道或组件名称"
msgstr "Comma-separated values: channel or component name"

msgid "USE_IR_LOC"
msgstr "USE_IR_LOC"

msgid "控制是否在生成的中间表示（IR）中包含位置信息（如文件名、行号等）。这些信息对调试很有帮助，但可能会增加生成的IR的大小。设置为1，会重新解析中间表示(IR)，将位置信息映射为具有特定扩展名的IR文件行号（而非Python源文件行号）。这能建立从IR到LLVM IR/PTX的直接映射关系。配合性能分析工具使用时，可实现对IR指令的细粒度性能剖析。"
msgstr "Controls whether to include location information (such as file names, line numbers, etc.) in the generated intermediate representation (IR). This information is helpful for debugging but may increase the size of the generated IR. When set to 1, the intermediate representation (IR) will be re-parsed to map location information to line numbers of IR files with specific extensions (rather than Python source file line numbers). This establishes a direct mapping from IR to LLVM IR/PTX. When used with performance analysis tools, it enables fine-grained performance profiling of IR instructions."

msgid "0：不包含位置信息<br>1：包含位置信息"
msgstr "0: No location information included<br>1: Location information included"

msgid "TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING"
msgstr "TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING"

msgid "在自动调优完成后，输出每个内核的最佳配置及总耗时。"
msgstr "After automatic tuning is completed, output the optimal configuration and total time consumption for each kernel."

msgid "0：不输出<br>1：输出"
msgstr "0: No output<br>1: Output"

msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_REMARK"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_REMARK"

msgid "启用MLIR 编译过程中的备注信息输出，包括以备注形式输出的性能警告。"
msgstr "Enable the output of remark information during MLIR compilation, including performance warnings output as remarks."

msgid "0：不启用<br>1：启用"
msgstr "0: Disabled<br>1: Enabled"

msgid "TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP"
msgstr "TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP"

msgid "启用或禁用 Triton 内核的转储功能，当启用时，Triton 会将生成的内核代码（各编译阶段IR及最终PTX）保存到指定目录。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the dump function of the Triton kernel. When enabled, Triton saves the generated kernel code (IR at each compilation stage and final PTX) to the specified directory."

msgid "TRITON_DUMP_DIR"
msgstr "TRITON_DUMP_DIR"

msgid "~/.triton/dump"
msgstr "~/.triton/dump"

msgid "指定 Triton 内核转储文件的保存目录。当`TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP=1`时保存IR和PTX的目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the directory for saving Triton kernel dump files. The directory where IR and PTX are saved when `TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP=1`."

msgid "\"path\"：保存路径"
msgstr "\"path\": save path"

msgid "TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT"
msgstr "TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT"

msgid "当设置为`1` 或者 `true`时（`TRUE` 将被转换为 `true`），启用`tl.device_print`功能。 重要说明：该功能使用GM缓冲区（其指针被传递给内核）。"
msgstr "When set to `1` or `true` (`TRUE` will be converted to `true`), the `tl.device_print` function is enabled. Important note: This function uses the GM buffer (its pointer is passed to the kernel)."

msgid "0：不启动<br>1：启用`tl.device_print`功能"
msgstr "0: Not started<br>1: Enable `tl.device_print` function"

msgid "每个线程的GM缓冲区最大为16KB，超限内容将被丢弃。该值目前固定，后续将通过环境变量调整。"
msgstr "The maximum GM buffer per thread is 16KB; content exceeding this limit will be discarded. This value is currently fixed and will be adjustable via environment variables in the future."

msgid "TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY"
msgstr "TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY"

msgid "控制是否生成内存使用情况的 json 文件。当`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY=1`时保存 memory_info_aic/aiv.json 文件到当前目录 。"
msgstr "Controls whether to generate a JSON file for memory usage. When `TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY=1`, save the memory_info_aic/aiv.json file to the current directory."

msgid "**编译控制**"
msgstr "**Compilation Control**"

msgid "TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE"
msgstr "TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE"

msgid "控制 Triton 是否每次运行都强制重新编译内核，而不是使用已有的缓存版本。 默认情况下，Triton 会对已经编译过的内核进行缓存（基于参数和配置），以提高性能。 设置为 1 后，Triton 将忽略缓存并每次都重新编译内核，这在调试或测试新编译器特性时非常有用。"
msgstr "Controls whether Triton forces recompilation of kernels on every run instead of using cached versions. By default, Triton caches already compiled kernels (based on parameters and configurations) to improve performance. When set to 1, Triton will ignore the cache and recompile kernels each time, which is useful for debugging or testing new compiler features."

msgid "0：不启用<br>1：每次运行都重新编译所有内核"
msgstr "0: Disabled<br>1: Recompile all kernels every time it runs"

msgid "DISABLE_LLVM_OPT"
msgstr "DISABLE_LLVM_OPT"

msgid "当设置为 1 时，可以禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的优化步骤(make_llir和make_ptx的LLVM优化)。当设置为字符串，解析为要禁用的LLVM优化标志列表。例如使用`DISABLE_LLVM_OPT=\"disable-lsr\"`可禁用循环强度优化（该优化在某些存在寄存器压力的内核中可能导致高达10%的性能波动）。"
msgstr "When set to 1, it can disable the optimization steps in the LLVM compilation process (LLVM optimizations for make_llir and make_ptx). When set to a string, it is parsed as a list of LLVM optimization flags to disable. For example, using `DISABLE_LLVM_OPT=\"disable-lsr\"` can disable loop strength reduction optimization (which may cause up to 10% performance fluctuation in some kernels with register pressure)."

msgid "0：LLVM 的优化是启用状态<br>1：禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的优化步骤(make_llir和make_ptx的LLVM优化) <list>:\"disable-lsr\":禁用循环强度优化 </list>"
msgstr "0: LLVM optimization is enabled<br>1: Disable optimization steps during LLVM compilation (LLVM optimization for make_llir and make_ptx) <list>:\"disable-lsr\": Disable loop strength reduction optimization </list>"

msgid "MLIR_ENABLE_TIMING"
msgstr "MLIR_ENABLE_TIMING"

msgid "启用或禁用 MLIR 编译过程中的时间统计功能。"
msgstr "Enable or disable time statistics during the MLIR compilation process."

msgid "LLVM_ENABLE_TIMING"
msgstr "LLVM_ENABLE_TIMING"

msgid "启用或禁用 LLVM 编译过程中的时间统计功能。"
msgstr "Enable or disable time statistics during the LLVM compilation process."

msgid "TRITON_DEFAULT_FP_FUSION"
msgstr "TRITON_DEFAULT_FP_FUSION"

msgid "1 启用"
msgstr "1 Enable"

msgid "控制是否默认启用浮点运算融合优化，覆盖默认的浮点运算融合行为（如mul+add->fma）。"
msgstr "Controls whether to enable floating-point arithmetic fusion optimization by default, overriding the default floating-point arithmetic fusion behavior (e.g., mul+add->fma)."

msgid "TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE"
msgstr "TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE"

msgid "启用或禁用 Triton 内核覆盖功能，允许在每个编译阶段开始时用用户指定的外部文件（IR/PTX等）覆盖默认生成的内核代码。"
msgstr "Enable or disable the Triton kernel override feature, allowing user-specified external files (IR/PTX, etc.) to override the default generated kernel code at the beginning of each compilation stage."

msgid "TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR"
msgstr "TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR"

msgid "~/.triton/override"
msgstr "~/.triton/override"

msgid "指定 Triton 内核覆盖文件的查找目录。当`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE=1`时加载IR/PTX文件的目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the search directory for Triton kernel override files. The directory from which IR/PTX files are loaded when `TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE=1`."

msgid "TRITON_ASCEND_COMPILE_SPEED_OPT"
msgstr "TRITON_ASCEND_COMPILE_SPEED_OPT"

msgid "控制JIT编译器在发现内核编译失败后是否跳过后续编译阶段。设为`1`跳过（默认`0`继续尝试）。"
msgstr "Controls whether the JIT compiler skips subsequent compilation phases after a kernel compilation failure. Set to `1` to skip (default `0` continues attempting)."

msgid "0：继续尝试<br>1：跳过"
msgstr "0: Continue trying<br>1: Skip"

msgid "TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY"
msgstr "TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY"

msgid "remote_launch时使用，只编译不运行。"
msgstr "Used during remote_launch, only compile without running."

msgid "TRITON_DISABLE_FFTS"
msgstr "TRITON_DISABLE_FFTS"

msgid "是否禁用FFTS。"
msgstr "Whether to disable FFTS."

msgid "0：启用<br>1：禁用"
msgstr "0: Enable<br>1: Disable"

msgid "TRITON_DISABLE_PRECOMPILE"
msgstr "TRITON_DISABLE_PRECOMPILE"

msgid "是否禁用预编译。"
msgstr "Whether to disable precompilation."

msgid "0：启用预编译<br>1：禁用预编译"
msgstr "0: Enable precompilation<br>1: Disable precompilation"

msgid "**运行与调度**"
msgstr "**Operation and Scheduling**"

msgid "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL"
msgstr "TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL"

msgid "启用或禁用自动根据物理核数优化逻辑核数，仅当逻辑核间可并行时方可启动。当逻辑核数大于物理核数时，启动该优化，则编译器自动调整逻辑核数量为物理核数，减少调度开销；启用后允许grid>65535。限制：triton kernel的逻辑必须对执行顺序不敏感才能开启该选项，否则可能会导致死锁。per-kernel 选项 `enable_auto_blockify`（详见 `architecture_difference.md`）在显式设置时优先于该环境变量；环境变量仅对未设置 `enable_auto_blockify` 的 kernel 起默认值作用。"
msgstr "Enable or disable automatic optimization of logical core count based on physical core count; this can only be activated when logical cores can run in parallel. When the number of logical cores exceeds the number of physical cores, enabling this optimization allows the compiler to automatically adjust the logical core count to match the physical core count, reducing scheduling overhead. When enabled, grid > 65535 is allowed. Limitation: The logic of the Triton kernel must be insensitive to execution order for this option to be enabled; otherwise, it may cause deadlocks. The per-kernel option `enable_auto_blockify` (see `architecture_difference.md`) takes precedence over this environment variable when explicitly set; the environment variable only serves as a default value for kernels that do not have `enable_auto_blockify` set."

