msgstr "Installation FAQ"

msgid "**问题一：安装TorchNPU时出现报错“ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu”**"
msgstr "**Issue 1: Error \"ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu\" occurs when installing TorchNPU**"

msgid "**解决措施**"
msgstr "**Solution Measures**"

msgid "可以尝试手动安装torch后再安装TorchNPU："
msgstr "You can try manually installing torch before installing TorchNPU."

msgid "**问题二：编译安装Triton-Ascend时，如果GCC < 9.4.0，可能报错 “ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs”**"
msgstr "**Issue 2: When compiling and installing Triton-Ascend, if GCC < 9.4.0, the error \"ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs\" may occur.**"

msgid "一般是链接器无法找到stdc++fs库引起的报错。该库用于支持GCC 9之前版本的文件系统特性。此时需要手动把CMake文件中以下相关代码片段的注释打开。 文件路径：triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"
msgstr "This error is usually caused by the linker being unable to find the stdc++fs library. This library is used to support filesystem features in versions prior to GCC 9. In this case, you need to manually uncomment the following relevant code snippet in the CMake file. File path: triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"

msgid "**问题三：执行算子时报错 ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package**"
msgstr "**Issue 3: When executing an operator, an error is reported: ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package**"

msgid "**根因分析**"
msgstr "**Root Cause Analysis**"

msgid "triton-ascend目录被triton覆盖,导致triton-ascend功能受损。"
msgstr "The triton-ascend directory is overwritten by triton, causing damage to triton-ascend functionality."

msgid "卸载已损坏的triton-ascend,重新安装即可。以3.2.1 版本为例，可执行如下命令修复："
msgstr "Uninstall the damaged triton-ascend and reinstall it. Taking version 3.2.1 as an example, you can execute the following command to fix it:"

msgid "**问题四：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本为何新增依赖triton？**"
msgstr "**Question 4: Why does Triton-Ascend version 3.2.1 add a dependency on triton?**"

msgid "答复：Triton-Ascend是基于Triton进行的二次开发，与Triton安装目录同名。若用户安装Triton-Ascend之后，在此安装Triton或依赖Triton的三方件，会覆盖Triton目录，导致Triton-Ascend功能受损。 因此通过增加Triton依赖，当Triton被覆盖安装时会有如下提醒。"
msgstr "Reply: Triton-Ascend is a secondary development based on Triton and shares the same name as the Triton installation directory. If users install Triton or third-party components that depend on Triton after installing Triton-Ascend, it will overwrite the Triton directory, causing damage to Triton-Ascend's functionality. Therefore, by adding a Triton dependency, the following warning will be displayed when Triton is overwritten during installation."

msgid "若用户遇到且想恢复Triton-Ascend功能，可做如下操作："
msgstr "If users encounter issues and wish to restore the Triton-Ascend functionality, they can perform the following operations:"

msgid "**问题五：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本依赖的Triton版本为何不一致？**"
msgstr "**Question 5: Why are the Triton versions depended on by Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 inconsistent?**"

msgid "答复：X86与Arm使用不同版本的社区Triton安装包，是因为社区从Triton 3.2版本开始提供X86安装包，而Arm安装包是从Triton 3.5版本开始提供的。"
msgstr "Answer: X86 and Arm use different versions of the community Triton installation package because the community started providing the X86 installation package from Triton version 3.2, while the Arm installation package has been available since Triton version 3.5."

msgid "**问题六：如何确认芯片类型**"
msgstr "**Question 6: How to Confirm the Chip Type**"

msgid "您可以使用npu-smi命令查看系统上的NPU型号。例如，在npu-smi info命令的输出中，\"910B4\" 对应芯片类型A2（昇腾910b系列）："
msgstr "You can use the `npu-smi` command to check the NPU model on the system. For example, in the output of the `npu-smi info` command, \"910B4\" corresponds to chip type A2 (Ascend 910b series)."

msgid "Libdevice 开发者手册"
msgstr "Libdevice Developer Guide"

msgid "SIMT 编译示例"
msgstr "SIMT Compilation Example"

msgid "使用 SIMT 编译的 triton kernel 示例"
msgstr "Example of a triton kernel compiled using SIMT"

msgid "1. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.abs"
msgstr "triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.abs"

msgid "OP概述"
msgstr "Overview of OP"

msgid "计算输入参数的绝对值。"
msgstr "Compute the absolute value of the input parameter."

msgid "原型:"
msgstr "Prototype:"

msgid "输入类型："
msgstr "Input Type:"

msgid "x: `int32`, `float32`"
msgstr "x: `int32`, `float32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的绝对值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the absolute value of the input parameter."

msgid "返回类型：`int32`, `float32`"
msgstr "Return type: `int32`, `float32`"

msgid "支持编译模式：SIMT"
msgstr "Supported compilation mode: SIMT"

msgid "2. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.acos"
msgstr "2. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.acos"

msgid "计算输入参数的反余弦值。"
msgstr "Computes the arccosine of the input parameter."

msgid "x: `float32`"
msgstr "x: `float32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的反余弦值，取值范围 \\[0, π] 弧度。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the arccosine of the input parameter, with a value range of \\[0, π] radians."

msgid "返回类型：`float32`"
msgstr "Return type: `float32`"

msgid "支持编译模式：SIMT, SIMD"
msgstr "Supported compilation modes: SIMT, SIMD"

msgid "3. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.acosh"
msgstr "3. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.acosh"

msgid "计算输入参数的反双曲余弦值。"
msgstr "Compute the inverse hyperbolic cosine of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的反双曲余弦值，取值范围 \\[0, +∞]。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the inverse hyperbolic cosine of the input parameter, with a value range of \\[0, +∞]."

msgid "4. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_rd"
msgstr "4. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_rd"

msgid "向下舍入浮点数加法。"
msgstr "Round down floating-point addition."

msgid "y: `float32`"
msgstr "y: `float32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向下舍入的加法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of rounding down addition."

msgid "5. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_rn"
msgstr "5. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入浮点数加法。"
msgstr "Recent round-to-even floating-point addition."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回最近偶数舍入的加法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of addition rounded to the nearest even number."

msgid "6. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_ru"
msgstr "6. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_ru"

msgid "向上舍入浮点数加法。"
msgstr "Round up floating-point addition."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向上舍入的加法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of rounding up addition."

msgid "7. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_rz"
msgstr "7. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.add_rz"

msgid "向零舍入浮点数加法。"
msgstr "Round floating-point addition towards zero."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向零舍入的加法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of addition rounded towards zero."

msgid "8. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.asin"
msgstr "8. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.asin"

msgid "计算输入参数的反正弦值。"
msgstr "Compute the arcsine of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的反正弦值，取值范围 \\[-π/2, π/2] 弧度。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the arcsine of the input parameter, with a value range of \\[-π/2, π/2] radians."

msgid "9. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.asinh"
msgstr "9. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.asinh"

msgid "计算输入参数的反双曲正弦值。"
msgstr "Compute the inverse hyperbolic sine of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的反双曲正弦值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the inverse hyperbolic sine of the input parameter."

msgid "10. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.atan"
msgstr "10. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.atan"

msgid "计算输入参数的反正切值。"
msgstr "Compute the arctangent of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的反正切值，取值范围 \\[-π/2, π/2] 弧度。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the arctangent of the input parameter, with a range of \\[-π/2, π/2] radians."

msgid "11. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.atan2"
msgstr "11. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.atan2"

msgid "反正切函数，计算 x / y 的反正切值。"
msgstr "Arctangent function, computes the arctangent of x / y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x / y 的反正切值，取值范围 \\[-π, π] 弧度。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the arctangent of x / y, with a value range of \\[-π, π] radians."

msgid "12. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.atanh"
msgstr "12. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.atanh"

msgid "反双曲正切函数，计算输入参数的反双曲正切值。"
msgstr "Inverse hyperbolic tangent function, computes the inverse hyperbolic tangent of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的反双曲正切值，取值范围 \\[-1, 1]。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the inverse hyperbolic tangent of the input parameter, with a value range of \\[-1, 1]."

msgid "13. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.brev"
msgstr "13. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.brev"

msgid "位反转函数，反转32位整数的位顺序。"
msgstr "Bit reversal function, reverses the bit order of a 32-bit integer."

msgid "x: `int32`"
msgstr "x: `int32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回位反转后的32位整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the bit-reversed 32-bit integer."

msgid "返回类型：`int32`"
msgstr "Return type: `int32`"

msgid "14. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.byte_perm"
msgstr "14. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.byte_perm"

msgid "字节排列操作，从两个32位整数中选择字节组成新整数。输入整数 x 和 y 的字节顺序如下。"
msgstr "Byte permutation operation: select bytes from two 32-bit integers to form a new integer. The byte order of input integers x and y is as follows."

msgid "字节选择参数 s 为32位整数，各比特位与字节选择对应关系如下。"
msgstr "The byte selection parameter s is a 32-bit integer, and the correspondence between each bit and byte selection is as follows."

msgid "y: `int32`"
msgstr "y: `int32`"

msgid "s: `int32`"
msgstr "s: `int32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回值 return\\[n] := input\\[selector\\[n]]，n 表示输出整数的第 n 个字节。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, return value return[n] := input[selector[n]], where n represents the n-th byte of the output integer."

msgid "15. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cbrt"
msgstr "15. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cbrt"

msgid "计算输入参数的立方根值。"
msgstr "Calculate the cube root of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的立方根值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the cube root of the input parameter."

msgid "16. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ceil"
msgstr "16. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ceil"

msgid "向上取整，返回大于或等于 x 的最小整数。"
msgstr "Round up, returning the smallest integer greater than or equal to x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向上取整的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of rounding up."

msgid "17. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.clz"
msgstr "17. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.clz"

msgid "计算32位整数的前导零数量。"
msgstr "Count the number of leading zeros in a 32-bit integer."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的前导零数量。范围 \\[0, 32]。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the number of leading zeros in the input parameter. Range [0, 32]."

msgid "18. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.copysign"
msgstr "18. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.copysign"

msgid "生成一个浮点数，其绝对值等于 x 的绝对值，符号与 y 相同。"
msgstr "Generate a floating-point number whose absolute value equals the absolute value of x, with the same sign as y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回一个浮点数，其绝对值等于 x 的绝对值，符号与 y 相同。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns a floating-point number whose absolute value equals the absolute value of x, with the same sign as y."

msgid "19. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cos"
msgstr "19. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cos"

msgid "计算输入参数（弧度）的余弦值。"
msgstr "Compute the cosine of the input parameter (in radians)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的余弦值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the cosine of the input argument."

msgid "20. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cosh"
msgstr "20. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cosh"

msgid "计算输入参数的双曲余弦值。"
msgstr "Compute the hyperbolic cosine of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的双曲余弦值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the hyperbolic cosine of the input parameter."

msgid "21. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cospi"
msgstr "21. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cospi"

msgid "计算 cos(π × x) 的值。"
msgstr "Compute the value of cos(π × x)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 cos(π × x) 的值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the value of cos(π × x)."

msgid "22. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cyl_bessel_i0"
msgstr "22. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cyl_bessel_i0"

msgid "计算输入参数的修正零阶贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Compute the modified Bessel function of the first kind of order zero for the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的修正零阶贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the modified zero-order Bessel function value of the input parameter."

msgid "23. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cyl_bessel_i1"
msgstr "23. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.cyl_bessel_i1"

msgid "计算输入参数的修正一阶贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Computes the modified first-order Bessel function value of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的修正一阶贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the modified first-order Bessel function value of the input parameter."

msgid "24. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_rd"
msgstr "24. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_rd"

msgid "向下舍入浮点数除法。"
msgstr "Round down floating-point division."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回除法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of division."

msgid "25. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_rn"
msgstr "25. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入浮点数除法。"
msgstr "Recent round-to-even floating-point division."

msgid "26. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_ru"
msgstr "26. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_ru"

msgid "向上舍入浮点数除法。"
msgstr "Rounds up floating-point division."

msgid "27. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_rz"
msgstr "27. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.div_rz"

msgid "向零舍入浮点数除法。"
msgstr "Round floating-point division toward zero."

msgid "28. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erf"
msgstr "28. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erf"

msgid "计算输入参数的误差函数值。"
msgstr "Computes the error function value of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的误差函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the error function value of the input parameters."

msgid "29. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfc"
msgstr "29. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfc"

msgid "计算输入参数的互补误差函数值，即 1 - erf(x)。"
msgstr "Computes the complementary error function value of the input argument, i.e., 1 - erf(x)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的互补误差函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the complementary error function value of the input parameter."

msgid "30. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfcinv"
msgstr "30. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfcinv"

msgid "逆互补误差函数，找到满足 x = erfc(y) 的值 y。"
msgstr "Inverse complementary error function, find the value y that satisfies x = erfc(y)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的逆互补误差函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the inverse complementary error function value of the input parameter."

msgid "31. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfcx"
msgstr "31. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfcx"

msgid "计算输入参数的缩放互补误差函数值，即 exp(x²) × erfc(x)。"
msgstr "Compute the scaled complementary error function value of the input parameter, i.e., exp(x²) × erfc(x)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的缩放互补误差函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the scaled complementary error function value of the input parameter."

msgid "32. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfinv"
msgstr "32. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.erfinv"

msgid "逆误差函数，找到满足 x = erf(y) 的值 y。"
msgstr "Inverse error function, find the value y such that x = erf(y)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的逆误差函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the inverse error function value of the input parameter."

msgid "33. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.exp"
msgstr "33. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.exp"

msgid "指数函数，计算 e 的 x 次方。"
msgstr "Exponential function, computes e raised to the power of x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 e 的 x 次方的计算结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of e raised to the power of x."

msgid "34. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.exp10"
msgstr "34. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.exp10"

msgid "以 10 为底的指数函数，计算 10 的 x 次方。"
msgstr "The exponential function with base 10, computes 10 raised to the power of x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 10 的 x 次方的计算结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of 10 raised to the power of x."

msgid "35. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.exp2"
msgstr "35. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.exp2"

msgid "以 2 为底的指数函数，计算 2 的 x 次方。"
msgstr "Exponential function with base 2, computes 2 raised to the power of x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 2 的 x 次方的计算结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of 2 raised to the power of x."

msgid "36. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.expm1"
msgstr "36. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.expm1"

msgid "计算 e 的 x 次方减 1 的结果。"
msgstr "Compute the result of e raised to the power of x minus 1."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 e 的 x 次方减 1 的计算结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of e raised to the power of x minus 1."

msgid "37. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_cosf"
msgstr "37. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_cosf"

msgid "快速近似余弦函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate cosine function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似余弦函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the fast approximate cosine function."

msgid "38. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_dividef"
msgstr "38. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_dividef"

msgid "快速近似除法。"
msgstr "Fast approximate division."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似除法的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of fast approximate division."

msgid "39. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_exp10f"
msgstr "39. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_exp10f"

msgid "快速近似以 10 为底的指数函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate base-10 exponential function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似以 10 为底的指数函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of a fast approximation of the base-10 exponential function."

msgid "40. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_expf"
msgstr "40. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_expf"

msgid "快速近似指数函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate exponential function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似指数函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the fast approximate exponential function."

msgid "41. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_log10f"
msgstr "41. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_log10f"

msgid "快速近似以 10 为底的对数函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate base-10 logarithm function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似以 10 为底的对数函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of a fast approximation of the base-10 logarithm function."

msgid "42. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_log2f"
msgstr "42. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_log2f"

msgid "快速近似以 2 为底的对数函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate base-2 logarithm function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似以 2 为底的对数函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of a fast approximation of the base-2 logarithm function."

msgid "43. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_logf"
msgstr "43. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_logf"

msgid "快速近似自然对数函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate natural logarithm function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似自然对数函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the fast approximate natural logarithm function."

msgid "44. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_powf"
msgstr "44. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_powf"

msgid "快速近似幂函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate power function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似幂函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the fast approximate power function."

msgid "45. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_sinf"
msgstr "45. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_sinf"

msgid "快速近似正弦函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate sine function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似正弦函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the fast approximate sine function."

msgid "46. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_tanf"
msgstr "46. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fast_tanf"

msgid "快速近似正切函数。"
msgstr "Fast approximate tangent function."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回快速近似正切函数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the fast approximate tangent function."

msgid "47. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fdim"
msgstr "47. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fdim"

msgid "计算 x 与 y 的正差。当 x > y 时，返回 x - y，否则返回 0。"
msgstr "Compute the positive difference between x and y. When x > y, return x - y; otherwise, return 0."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 与 y 之间的正差。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the positive difference between x and y."

msgid "48. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ffs"
msgstr "48. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ffs"

msgid "查找第一个被置为1的位，返回最低被置为1的位的索引。"
msgstr "Find the first bit set to 1, returning the index of the lowest bit set to 1."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回最低被置为1的位的索引，取值范围 \\[0, 32]。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the index of the lowest set bit, with a range of [0, 32]."

msgid "49. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.finitef"
msgstr "49. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.finitef"

msgid "判断输入是否为有限浮点数。"
msgstr "Determine whether the input is a finite floating-point number."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 若输入为有限值返回 True，否则返回 False。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns True if the input is finite, otherwise returns False."

msgid "返回类型：`bool`"
msgstr "Return type: `bool`"

msgid "50. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_rd"
msgstr "50. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位整数。"
msgstr "The round-toward-zero rounding mode converts a floating-point number to a 32-bit integer."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回转换后的32位整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the converted 32-bit integer."

msgid "51. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_rn"
msgstr "51. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位整数。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode converts floating-point numbers to 32-bit integers."

msgid "52. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_ru"
msgstr "52. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位整数。"
msgstr "The round-up mode converts floating-point numbers to 32-bit integers."

msgid "53. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_rz"
msgstr "53. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2int_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位整数。"
msgstr "The round-toward-zero mode converts a floating-point number to a 32-bit integer."

msgid "54. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_rd"
msgstr "54. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位整数。"
msgstr "The round-down mode converts a floating-point number to a 64-bit integer."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回转换后的64位整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the converted 64-bit integer."

msgid "返回类型：`int64`"
msgstr "Return type: `int64`"

msgid "55. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_rn"
msgstr "55. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位整数。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode converts floating-point numbers to 64-bit integers."

msgid "56. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_ru"
msgstr "56. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位整数。"
msgstr "The round-up mode converts floating-point numbers to 64-bit integers."

msgid "57. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_rz"
msgstr "57. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ll_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位整数。"
msgstr "The round-toward-zero mode converts a floating-point number to a 64-bit integer."

msgid "58. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_rd"
msgstr "58. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位无符号整数。"
msgstr "Downward rounding mode converts floating-point numbers to 32-bit unsigned integers."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回转换后的32位无符号整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the converted 32-bit unsigned integer."

msgid "返回类型：`uint32`"
msgstr "Return type: `uint32`"

msgid "59. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_rn"
msgstr "59. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位无符号整数。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode converts floating-point numbers to 32-bit unsigned integers."

msgid "60. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_ru"
msgstr "60. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位无符号整数。"
msgstr "The round-up mode converts a floating-point number to a 32-bit unsigned integer."

msgid "61. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_rz"
msgstr "61. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2uint_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式将浮点数转换为32位无符号整数。"
msgstr "Round-to-zero mode converts a floating-point number to a 32-bit unsigned integer."

msgid "62. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_rd"
msgstr "62. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位无符号整数。"
msgstr "The round-down mode converts a floating-point number to a 64-bit unsigned integer."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回转换后的64位无符号整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the converted 64-bit unsigned integer."

msgid "返回类型：`uint64`"
msgstr "Return type: `uint64`"

msgid "63. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_rn"
msgstr "63. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位无符号整数。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode converts floating-point numbers to 64-bit unsigned integers."

msgid "64. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_ru"
msgstr "64. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位无符号整数。"
msgstr "The round-up mode converts floating-point numbers to 64-bit unsigned integers."

msgid "65. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_rz"
msgstr "65. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float2ull_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式将浮点数转换为64位无符号整数。"
msgstr "The round-toward-zero mode converts a floating-point number to a 64-bit unsigned integer."

msgid "66. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float_as_int"
msgstr "66. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float_as_int"

msgid "将浮点数的比特位重新解释为32位整数。不进行数值转换。"
msgstr "Reinterpret the bits of a floating-point number as a 32-bit integer. No numerical conversion is performed."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回将浮点数的比特位重新解释为32位整数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of reinterpreting the bits of a floating-point number as a 32-bit integer."

msgid "67. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float_as_uint"
msgstr "67. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.float_as_uint"

msgid "将浮点数的比特位重新解释为32位无符号整数。不进行数值转换。"
msgstr "Reinterpret the bits of a floating-point number as a 32-bit unsigned integer. No numerical conversion is performed."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回将浮点数的比特位重新解释为32位无符号整数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of reinterpreting the bits of a floating-point number as a 32-bit unsigned integer."

msgid "68. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.floor"
msgstr "68. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.floor"

msgid "向下取整，返回小于或等于 x 的最大整数。"
msgstr "Floor, returns the greatest integer less than or equal to x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向下取整的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of rounding down."

msgid "69. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma"
msgstr "69. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma"

msgid "融合乘加，计算 x × y + z。"
msgstr "Fused multiply-add, computes x × y + z."

msgid "z: `float32`"
msgstr "z: `float32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回融合乘加的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the fused multiply-add."

msgid "70. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_rd"
msgstr "70. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式下的融合乘加操作。"
msgstr "Fused multiply-add operation in round-toward-zero mode."

msgid "71. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_rn"
msgstr "71. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式下的融合乘加操作。"
msgstr "The fused multiply-add operation in the nearest even rounding mode."

msgid "72. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_ru"
msgstr "72. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式下的融合乘加操作。"
msgstr "Fused multiply-add operation in round-up mode."

msgid "73. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_rz"
msgstr "73. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fma_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式下的融合乘加操作。"
msgstr "Fused multiply-add operation in round-toward-zero mode."

msgid "74. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fmod"
msgstr "74. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.fmod"

msgid "浮点数取模，计算 x / y 的余数，结果与 x 同号。"
msgstr "Floating-point modulus, calculates the remainder of x / y, with the result having the same sign as x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回浮点数取模的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of floating-point modulo operation."

msgid "75. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.gamma"
msgstr "75. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.gamma"

msgid "计算输入参数的伽马函数值。"
msgstr "Calculates the gamma function value of the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的伽马函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the gamma function value of the input parameter."

msgid "76. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.hadd"
msgstr "76. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.hadd"

msgid "计算 x 和 y 的平均值。"
msgstr "Calculate the average of x and y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 和 y 的平均值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the mean of x and y."

msgid "77. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.hypot"
msgstr "77. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.hypot"

msgid "计算 x 和 y 之间的欧几里得距离。"
msgstr "Compute the Euclidean distance between x and y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 和 y 之间的欧几里得距离。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the Euclidean distance between x and y."

msgid "78. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ilogb"
msgstr "78. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ilogb"

msgid "提取浮点数的无偏指数（以2为底的整数对数）。"
msgstr "Extracts the unbiased exponent of a floating-point number (integer logarithm base 2)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的无偏指数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the unbiased exponential value of the input parameter."

msgid "79. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_rd"
msgstr "79. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式将32位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-down mode converts a 32-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回转换后的浮点数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the converted floating-point number."

msgid "80. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_rn"
msgstr "80. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式将32位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode converts a 32-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "81. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_ru"
msgstr "81. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式将32位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-up mode converts a 32-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "82. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_rz"
msgstr "82. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int2float_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式将32位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-toward-zero mode converts a 32-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "83. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int_as_float"
msgstr "83. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.int_as_float"

msgid "将32位整数的比特位重新解释为浮点数。不进行数值转换。"
msgstr "Reinterpret the bits of a 32-bit integer as a floating-point number. No numerical conversion is performed."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回将32位整数的比特位重新解释为浮点数的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of reinterpreting the bits of a 32-bit integer as a floating-point number."

msgid "84. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.isinf"
msgstr "84. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.isinf"

msgid "判断输入是否为无穷大。"
msgstr "Determine whether the input is infinite."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 若输入为无穷大返回 True，否则返回 False。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns True if the input is infinite, otherwise returns False."

msgid "85. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.isnan"
msgstr "85. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.isnan"

msgid "判断输入是否为 NaN（非数值）。"
msgstr "Determine whether the input is NaN (Not a Number)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 若输入为 NaN 返回 True，否则返回 False。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns True if the input is NaN, otherwise returns False."

msgid "86. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.j0"
msgstr "86. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.j0"

msgid "计算输入参数的零阶第一类贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Computes the value of the Bessel function of the first kind of order zero for the input argument."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的零阶第一类贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the value of the zero-order Bessel function of the first kind for the input argument."

msgid "87. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.j1"
msgstr "87. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.j1"

msgid "计算输入参数的一阶第一类贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Compute the value of the first-order Bessel function of the first kind for the input parameter."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的一阶第一类贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the value of the Bessel function of the first kind of order one for the input parameter."

msgid "88. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.jn"
msgstr "88. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.jn"

msgid "计算输入参数的 n 阶第一类贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Compute the value of the Bessel function of the first kind of order n for the input parameter."

msgid "n: `int32`"
msgstr "n: `int32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的 n 阶第一类贝塞尔函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the nth-order Bessel function of the first kind for the input parameters."

msgid "89. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ldexp"
msgstr "89. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ldexp"

msgid "计算 x × 2^exp 的值。"
msgstr "Compute the value of x × 2^exp."

msgid "exp: `int32`"
msgstr "exp: `int32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x × 2^exp 的计算结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of x × 2^exp."

msgid "90. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.lgamma"
msgstr "90. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.lgamma"

msgid "计算输入为 x 的伽马函数绝对值的自然对数。"
msgstr "Compute the natural logarithm of the absolute value of the gamma function for input x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入为 x 的伽马函数绝对值的自然对数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the natural logarithm of the absolute value of the gamma function with input x."

msgid "91. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_rd"
msgstr "91. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式将64位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-down mode converts a 64-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "x: `int64`"
msgstr "x: `int64`"

msgid "92. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_rn"
msgstr "92. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式将64位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode converts a 64-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "93. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_ru"
msgstr "93. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式将64位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-up mode converts a 64-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "94. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_rz"
msgstr "94. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.ll2float_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式将64位整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-toward-zero mode converts a 64-bit integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "95. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.llrint"
msgstr "95. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.llrint"

msgid "将浮点数舍入为最接近的64位整数值。"
msgstr "Rounds a floating-point number to the nearest 64-bit integer value."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回舍入后的64位整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the rounded 64-bit integer."

msgid "96. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.llround"
msgstr "96. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.llround"

msgid "将浮点数四舍五入为最接近的64位整数值。"
msgstr "Rounds a floating-point number to the nearest 64-bit integer value."

msgid "97. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log"
msgstr "97. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log"

msgid "计算输入为 x 的以 e 为底的对数。"
msgstr "Compute the natural logarithm (base e) of the input x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入为 x 的以 e 为底的对数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the natural logarithm (base e) of the input x."

msgid "98. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log10"
msgstr "98. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log10"

msgid "计算输入为 x 的以 10 为底的对数。"
msgstr "Compute the base-10 logarithm of the input x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入为 x 的以 10 为底的对数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the base-10 logarithm of the input x."

msgid "99. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log1p"
msgstr "99. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log1p"

msgid "计算 log(1 + x) 的值。"
msgstr "Compute the value of log(1 + x)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 log(1 + x) 的计算结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of log(1 + x)."

msgid "100. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log2"
msgstr "100. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.log2"

msgid "计算输入为 x 的以 2 为底的对数。"
msgstr "Computes the base-2 logarithm of the input x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入为 x 的以 2 为底的对数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the base-2 logarithm of input x."

msgid "101. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.logb"
msgstr "101. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.logb"

msgid "提取浮点数的指数值。"
msgstr "Extract the exponent value of a floating-point number."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入参数的指数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the exponential value of the input parameter."

msgid "102. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul24"
msgstr "102. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul24"

msgid "计算 x 和 y 的低24位乘法结果。"
msgstr "Compute the low 24-bit multiplication result of x and y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 和 y 的低24位乘法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the low 24-bit multiplication result of x and y."

msgid "103. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_rd"
msgstr "103. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_rd"

msgid "向下舍入浮点数乘法。"
msgstr "Round down floating-point multiplication."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回浮点数乘法的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of floating-point multiplication."

msgid "104. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_rn"
msgstr "104. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入浮点数乘法。"
msgstr "Recent round-to-even floating-point multiplication."

msgid "105. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_ru"
msgstr "105. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_ru"

msgid "向上舍入浮点数乘法。"
msgstr "Round up floating-point multiplication."

msgid "106. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_rz"
msgstr "106. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mul_rz"

msgid "向零舍入浮点数乘法。"
msgstr "Round floating-point multiplication toward zero."

msgid "107. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mulhi"
msgstr "107. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.mulhi"

msgid "计算 x 和 y 的乘法结果的高 32 位。"
msgstr "Compute the high 32 bits of the multiplication result of x and y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 和 y 的乘法结果的高 32 位。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the high 32 bits of the multiplication result of x and y."

msgid "108. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.nearbyint"
msgstr "108. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.nearbyint"

msgid "将 x 转换为最近邻整数。"
msgstr "Convert x to the nearest integer."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回最近邻整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the nearest integer."

msgid "109. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.nextafter"
msgstr "109. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.nextafter"

msgid "计算从 x 方向朝 y 的下一个可表示浮点数。"
msgstr "Compute the next representable floating-point number from x in the direction of y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回下一个可表示浮点数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the next representable floating-point number."

msgid "110. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.norm3d"
msgstr "110. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.norm3d"

msgid "计算三维向量的欧几里得范数，即 sqrt(x² + y² + z²)。"
msgstr "Compute the Euclidean norm of a three-dimensional vector, i.e., sqrt(x² + y² + z²)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回三维向量的欧几里得范数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the Euclidean norm of a three-dimensional vector."

msgid "111. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.norm4d"
msgstr "111. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.norm4d"

msgid "计算四维向量的欧几里得范数，即 sqrt(x² + y² + z² + w²)。"
msgstr "Compute the Euclidean norm of a 4D vector, i.e., sqrt(x² + y² + z² + w²)."

msgid "w: `float32`"
msgstr "w: `float32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回四维向量的欧几里得范数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the Euclidean norm of a four-dimensional vector."

msgid "112. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.normcdf"
msgstr "112. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.normcdf"

msgid "计算标准正态分布的累积分布函数值。"
msgstr "Calculate the cumulative distribution function value of the standard normal distribution."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回标准正态分布的累积分布函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the cumulative distribution function value of the standard normal distribution."

msgid "113. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.normcdfinv"
msgstr "113. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.normcdfinv"

msgid "计算标准正态分布累积分布函数的逆函数值。"
msgstr "Compute the inverse cumulative distribution function of the standard normal distribution."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回标准正态分布累积分布函数的逆函数值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the inverse function value of the standard normal cumulative distribution function."

msgid "114. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.popc"
msgstr "114. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.popc"

msgid "计算 x 中置位为 1 的数量。"
msgstr "Count the number of set bits (1s) in x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 中置位为 1 的数量，取值范围 \\[0, 32]。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the number of bits set to 1 in x, with a value range of [0, 32]."

msgid "115. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.pow"
msgstr "115. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.pow"

msgid "幂函数，计算 x 的 y 次方。"
msgstr "Power function, calculates x raised to the power of y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 的 y 次方。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns x raised to the power of y."

msgid "116. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcbrt"
msgstr "116. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcbrt"

msgid "计算 x 的立方根倒数。"
msgstr "Compute the reciprocal of the cube root of x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 的立方根倒数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the reciprocal of the cube root of x."

msgid "117. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_rd"
msgstr "117. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_rd"

msgid "向下舍入浮点数倒数运算。"
msgstr "Round down the reciprocal of a floating-point number."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 1 / x。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns 1 / x."

msgid "118. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_rn"
msgstr "118. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入浮点数倒数运算。"
msgstr "Recent even rounding floating-point reciprocal operation."

msgid "119. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_ru"
msgstr "119. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_ru"

msgid "向上舍入浮点数倒数运算。"
msgstr "Round up the reciprocal of a floating-point number."

msgid "120. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_rz"
msgstr "120. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rcp_rz"

msgid "向零舍入浮点数倒数运算。"
msgstr "Round floating-point reciprocal toward zero."

msgid "121. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.reciprocal"
msgstr "121. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.reciprocal"

msgid "计算 1 / x 的倒数运算。"
msgstr "Compute the reciprocal of 1 / x."

msgid "122. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.relu"
msgstr "122. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.relu"

msgid "修正线性单元函数，当 x > 0 时返回 x，否则返回 0。"
msgstr "Rectified Linear Unit function, returns x when x > 0, otherwise returns 0."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回修正线性单元的结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of the rectified linear unit."

msgid "123. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.remainder"
msgstr "123. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.remainder"

msgid "计算 x 对 y 的余数，满足 r = x - ny，其中 n 是 x / y 的最近邻整数。"
msgstr "Compute the remainder of x divided by y, satisfying r = x - ny, where n is the nearest integer to x / y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 对 y 的余数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the remainder of x divided by y."

msgid "124. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rhadd"
msgstr "124. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rhadd"

msgid "计算 x 和 y 平均值的取整结果。"
msgstr "Returns the rounded result of the average of x and y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 和 y 平均值的取整结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the rounded result of the average of x and y."

msgid "125. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rhypot"
msgstr "125. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rhypot"

msgid "计算 x 和 y 之间的欧几里得距离的倒数。"
msgstr "Compute the reciprocal of the Euclidean distance between x and y."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 和 y 之间的欧几里得距离的倒数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the reciprocal of the Euclidean distance between x and y."

msgid "126. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rint"
msgstr "126. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rint"

msgid "按最近偶数舍入模式计算 x 的最近邻整数。"
msgstr "Round x to the nearest integer using round-half-to-even mode."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 的最近邻整数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the nearest integer of x."

msgid "127. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rnorm3d"
msgstr "127. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rnorm3d"

msgid "计算三维向量的欧几里得范数的倒数。"
msgstr "Compute the reciprocal of the Euclidean norm of a three-dimensional vector."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回三维向量的欧几里得范数的倒数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the reciprocal of the Euclidean norm of a three-dimensional vector."

msgid "128. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rnorm4d"
msgstr "128. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rnorm4d"

msgid "计算四维向量的欧几里得范数的倒数。"
msgstr "Compute the reciprocal of the Euclidean norm of a four-dimensional vector."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回四维向量的欧几里得范数的倒数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the reciprocal of the Euclidean norm of a four-dimensional vector."

msgid "129. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.round"
msgstr "129. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.round"

msgid "130. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rsqrt"
msgstr "130. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rsqrt"

msgid "计算 x 的平方根倒数。"
msgstr "Compute the reciprocal of the square root of x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 的平方根倒数。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the reciprocal square root of x."

msgid "131. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rsqrt_rn"
msgstr "131. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.rsqrt_rn"

msgid "按最近偶数舍入模式计算 x 的平方根倒数。"
msgstr "Compute the reciprocal square root of x using round-to-nearest-even mode."

msgid "132. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sad"
msgstr "132. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sad"

msgid "计算 |x-y|+z，其中 x 和 y 是有符号整数，z 是无符号整数。"
msgstr "Compute |x-y|+z, where x and y are signed integers, and z is an unsigned integer."

msgid "z: `int32`"
msgstr "z: `int32`"

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 |x-y|+z。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns |x-y|+z."

msgid "133. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.saturatef"
msgstr "133. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.saturatef"

msgid "将 x 限制在 \\[+0.0, 1.0] 范围内。"
msgstr "Clamp x to the range \\[+0.0, 1.0]."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 的饱和值，取值范围 \\[+0.0, 1.0]。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the saturated value of x, with a value range of [+0.0, 1.0]."

msgid "134. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.scalbn"
msgstr "134. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.scalbn"

msgid "计算 x × 2^n 的值。"
msgstr "Compute the value of x × 2^n."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x × 2^n 的计算结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of x × 2^n."

msgid "135. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.signbit"
msgstr "135. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.signbit"

msgid "获取 x 的符号位。"
msgstr "Get the sign bit of x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 的符号位。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the sign bit of x."

msgid "136. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sin"
msgstr "136. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sin"

msgid "计算输入参数 x （弧度）的正弦值。"
msgstr "Calculate the sine of the input parameter x (in radians)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入 x 的正弦值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the sine of the input x."

msgid "137. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sinh"
msgstr "137. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sinh"

msgid "计算输入参数 x 的双曲正弦值。"
msgstr "Compute the hyperbolic sine of the input parameter x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入 x 的双曲正弦值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the hyperbolic sine of the input x."

msgid "138. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sinpi"
msgstr "138. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sinpi"

msgid "计算 sin(π × x) 的值。"
msgstr "Compute the value of sin(π × x)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 sin(π × x) 的值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the value of sin(π × x)."

msgid "139. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt"
msgstr "139. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt"

msgid "计算 x 的平方根值。"
msgstr "Compute the square root of x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回 x 的平方根值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the square root of x."

msgid "140. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_rd"
msgstr "140. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式计算 x 的平方根值。"
msgstr "The square root of x is calculated using the round-down mode."

msgid "141. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_rn"
msgstr "141. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式计算 x 的平方根值。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode calculates the square root of x."

msgid "142. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_ru"
msgstr "142. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式计算 x 的平方根值。"
msgstr "The square root of x is calculated using the round-up mode."

msgid "143. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_rz"
msgstr "143. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sqrt_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式计算 x 的平方根值。"
msgstr "Computes the square root of x with rounding toward zero."

msgid "144. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_rd"
msgstr "144. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_rd"

msgid "向下舍入浮点数减法。"
msgstr "Round down floating-point subtraction."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向下舍入的减法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of subtraction rounded down."

msgid "145. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_rn"
msgstr "145. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入浮点数减法。"
msgstr "Most recent even rounding floating-point subtraction."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回最近偶数舍入的减法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of subtraction rounded to the nearest even integer."

msgid "146. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_ru"
msgstr "146. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_ru"

msgid "向上舍入浮点数减法。"
msgstr "Round up floating-point subtraction."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向上舍入的减法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of subtraction rounded up."

msgid "147. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_rz"
msgstr "147. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.sub_rz"

msgid "向零舍入浮点数减法。"
msgstr "Round floating-point subtraction toward zero."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回向零舍入的减法结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the result of subtraction rounded toward zero."

msgid "148. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.tan"
msgstr "148. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.tan"

msgid "计算输入参数 x （弧度）的正切值。"
msgstr "Compute the tangent of the input parameter x (in radians)."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入 x 的正切值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the tangent of input x."

msgid "149. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.tanh"
msgstr "149. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.tanh"

msgid "计算输入参数 x 的双曲正切值。"
msgstr "Compute the hyperbolic tangent of the input parameter x."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回输入 x 的双曲正切值。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the hyperbolic tangent of input x."

msgid "150. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.tgamma"
msgstr "150. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.tgamma"

msgid "151. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.trunc"
msgstr "151. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.trunc"

msgid "截断取整，向零舍入到最近邻整数。"
msgstr "Truncation rounding, rounds toward zero to the nearest integer."

msgid "返回值: `tl.tensor`, 返回取整结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tl.tensor`, returns the rounding result."

msgid "152. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_rd"
msgstr "152. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_rd"

msgid "向下舍入模式将32位无符号整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-down mode converts a 32-bit unsigned integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "x: `uint32`"
msgstr "x: `uint32`"

msgid "153. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_rn"
msgstr "153. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_rn"

msgid "最近偶数舍入模式将32位无符号整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The nearest even rounding mode converts a 32-bit unsigned integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "154. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_ru"
msgstr "154. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_ru"

msgid "向上舍入模式将32位无符号整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-up mode converts a 32-bit unsigned integer to a floating-point number."

msgid "155. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_rz"
msgstr "155. triton.language.extra.cann.libdevice.uint2float_rz"

msgid "向零舍入模式将32位无符号整数转换为浮点数。"
msgstr "The round-toward-zero mode converts a 32-bit unsigned integer to a floating-point number."

