msgid "项目介绍"
msgstr "Project Introduction"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，用于高效进行核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署，通过兼容Triton核心语法并针对昇腾NPU特性进行深度优化，能够帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors, designed for efficient automatic kernel tuning, operator compilation, and deployment. By maintaining compatibility with Triton's core syntax and performing deep optimizations tailored to the characteristics of Ascend NPUs, it enables users to rapidly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend platform."

msgid "本文以**Ubuntu 22.04**环境下通过软件包部署方式在线安装并运行向量加法实例为例，指导用户快速上手使用**Triton-Ascend**。如需体验更多安装方式请阅读[安装指南](./installation_guide.md)文档。"
msgstr "This document uses the example of online installation and running a vector addition instance via software package deployment in an **Ubuntu 22.04** environment to guide users in quickly getting started with **Triton-Ascend**. For more installation methods, please refer to the [Installation Guide](./installation_guide.md) document."

msgid "支持的操作系统：linux（aarch64/x86_64）"
msgstr "Supported operating systems: Linux (aarch64/x86_64)"

msgid "支持的Ascend产品：Atlas A2/A3/950系列"
msgstr "Supported Ascend products: Atlas A2/A3/950 series"

msgid "最小硬件配置：单卡32GB内存（推荐）"
msgstr "Minimum hardware configuration: single card with 32GB memory (recommended)"

msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

msgid "向量加法实例：[01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) 通过对比Triton算子与PyTorch原生计算的输出结果，证明昇腾NPU设备可正确调用Triton算子并保证计算精度。"
msgstr "Vector addition example: [01-vector-add.py](../../third_party/ascend/tutorials/01-vector-add.py) demonstrates that the Ascend NPU device can correctly invoke the Triton operator and ensure computational accuracy by comparing the output results of the Triton operator with PyTorch native computation."

msgid "观察到类似的输出即说明环境配置正确。"
msgstr "Observing similar output indicates that the environment configuration is correct."

msgid "Triton-Ascend 版本发布"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend version released"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 版本提供了一个稳定的代码基础快照，封装成可以通过 PyPI 轻松安装的二进制包。此外，版本发布代表着开发团队可以向社区正式宣布新功能的可用性、已完成的改进以及可能影响用户的变化（例如破坏性变更）。"
msgstr "The Triton-Ascend version provides a stable snapshot of the codebase, packaged as a binary that can be easily installed via PyPI. Additionally, version releases represent an opportunity for the development team to formally announce to the community the availability of new features, completed improvements, and changes that may affect users (e.g., breaking changes)."

