msgid "1. OP 概述"
msgstr "1. OP Overview"

msgid "简介：原子性加法操作，在指定的内存位置执行原子加法 原型："
msgstr "Introduction: Atomic addition operation, performs atomic addition at the specified memory location. Prototype:"

