msgstr "`mask`"

msgid "`int1`或`tensor<int1>`，可选"
msgstr "`int1` or `tensor<int1>`, optional"

msgid "指定数据范围，防止访问越界"
msgstr "Specify the data range to prevent out-of-bounds access."

msgid "`sem`"
msgstr "`sem`"

msgid "`str`，可选"
msgstr "`str`, optional"

msgid "指定操作的内存语义<br>社区官方配置可接受的值为“acquire”、“release”、“acq_rel”（默认，代表“ACQUIRE_RELEASE”）和“relaxed”<br>我们只支持“acq_rel”：<br>- acquire：获取锁后，能够看到之前的释放操作（相当于一个“读取”操作，并且这个读取操作会阻塞，直到能够读取到“最新”的数据，也就是其他线程释放后的数据）<br>- release：在释放锁之前的所有操作，对后续获取锁的线程可见（相当于一个“写入”操作，并且这个写入操作会“同步”所有之前的写操作）"
msgstr "Memory semantics for specified operations<br>The community official configuration accepts values of \"acquire\", \"release\", \"acq_rel\" (default, representing \"ACQUIRE_RELEASE\"), and \"relaxed\"<br>We only support \"acq_rel\":<br>- acquire: After acquiring the lock, it can see previous release operations (equivalent to a \"read\" operation, and this read operation will block until it can read the \"latest\" data, i.e., data released by other threads)<br>- release: All operations before releasing the lock are visible to threads that subsequently acquire the lock (equivalent to a \"write\" operation, and this write operation \"synchronizes\" all previous write operations)"

msgid "`scope`"
msgstr "`scope`"

msgid "观察原子操作同步效果的线程范围<br>可接受的值为“gpu”（默认）、“cta”（协作线程数组、线程块）或“sys”（代表“SYSTEM”） <br>我们只支持“gpu”"
msgstr "Thread scope for observing atomic operation synchronization effects<br>Acceptable values are \"gpu\" (default), \"cta\" (cooperative thread array, thread block), or \"sys\" (representing \"SYSTEM\") <br>We only support \"gpu\""

msgid "`_semantic`"
msgstr "`_semantic`"

msgid "保留参数，暂不支持外部调用"
msgstr "Reserved parameter, external calls are not supported for now."

msgid "返回值： `pointer`：tensor，执行操作之前的旧值"
msgstr "Return value: `pointer`: tensor, the old value before performing the operation"

