msgid "triton.language.assume"
msgstr "triton.language.assume"

msgid "1. 函数概述"
msgstr "Function Overview"

msgid "`assume` 用于向编译器提供条件假设信息，允许编译器基于已知为真的条件进行优化。这是一个编译器提示操作，不会在运行时检查条件。"
msgstr "`assume` is used to provide conditional assumption information to the compiler, allowing the compiler to optimize based on conditions known to be true. This is a compiler hint operation and does not check the condition at runtime."

msgid "2. 规格"
msgstr "2. Specifications"

msgid "含义说明"
msgstr "Meaning Explanation"

msgid "`cond`"
msgstr "`cond`"

msgid "必需"
msgstr "Required"

msgid "编译器可以假设为真的条件表达式"
msgstr "The compiler can assume that the conditional expression is true."

msgid "2.2 类型支持"
msgstr "2.2 Type Support"

msgid "A3："
msgstr "A3:"

msgid "✓"
msgstr "✓"

msgid "2.3 使用方法"
msgstr "2.3 Usage Instructions"

msgid "`assume` 操作允许开发者在确保正确性的前提下，帮助编译器生成更高效的代码。"
msgstr "The `assume` operation allows developers to help the compiler generate more efficient code while ensuring correctness."

msgid "triton.language.debug_barrier"
msgstr "triton.language.debug_barrier"

msgid "`debug_barrier` 插入一条屏障指令，用于在调试时同步块中的所有线程，确保线程间的执行顺序。在同一块中的所有其他线程也到达该点之前，任何线程都不会继续执行该调用。"
msgstr "`debug_barrier` inserts a barrier instruction used to synchronize all threads in a block during debugging, ensuring the execution order among threads. No thread will proceed past this call until all other threads in the same block have also reached that point."

msgid "**注意：** `debug_barrier` 主要用于调试，通常不应在性能关键的生产代码中使用，因为它可能会因同步而引入开销。"
msgstr "**Note:** `debug_barrier` is primarily used for debugging and should generally not be used in performance-critical production code, as it may introduce overhead due to synchronization."

msgid "triton.language.max_constancy"
msgstr "triton.language.max_constancy"

msgid "`max_constancy` 用于向编译器声明输入张量中值的常量性模式，告知编译器输入数据中每组连续的值都是相等的。"
msgstr "`max_constancy` is used to declare to the compiler the constancy pattern of values in the input tensor, informing the compiler that each consecutive group of values in the input data is equal."

msgid "`Tensor`"
msgstr "`Tensor`"

msgid "输入张量，其值具有特定的常量性模式"
msgstr "Input tensor, whose values have a specific constancy pattern"

msgid "`values`"
msgstr "`values`"

msgid "`constexpr[int]` 或 `list[constexpr[int]]`"
msgstr "`constexpr[int]` or `list[constexpr[int]]`"

msgid "描述常量性模式的编译时常量整数（或整数序列）"
msgstr "Describes compile-time constant integers (or integer sequences) that follow a constant pattern."

msgid "**`values`描述着每个维度的恒定性特征，所以`values` 的维度要与`input` 的维度相同。 注意当`shape`的最后一维为`1`时出现的降维情况。**"
msgstr "**`values` describes the constancy characteristics of each dimension, so the dimension of `values` must be the same as that of `input`. Note the dimensionality reduction that occurs when the last dimension of `shape` is `1`.**"

msgid "如：二维 `input`对应通用`values`入参为`[1,1]`。"
msgstr "For example: the two-dimensional `input` corresponds to the general `values` input parameter as `[1,1]`."

msgid "Ascend 对比 GPU 缺失uint8、uint16、uint32、uint64、fp64的支持能力（硬件限制）。"
msgstr "Ascend lacks support for uint8, uint16, uint32, uint64, and fp64 compared to GPU (hardware limitation)."

msgid "triton.language.max_contiguous"
msgstr "triton.language.max_contiguous"

msgid "`max_contiguous` 用于向编译器声明输入张量中的连续性模式，告知编译器输入张量的前`value`个数是连续的。"
msgstr "`max_contiguous` is used to declare the contiguity pattern in the input tensor to the compiler, indicating that the first `value` elements of the input tensor are contiguous."

msgid "输入张量，其内存访问具有特定的连续性模式"
msgstr "Input tensor, whose memory access has a specific continuity pattern"

msgid "描述连续性模式的编译时常量整数（或整数序列）"
msgstr "Describes compile-time constant integers (or integer sequences) representing continuous patterns."

msgid "**`values`描述着每个维度的连续性特征，所以`values` 的维度要与`input` 的维度相同。 注意当`shape`的最后一维为`1`时出现的降维情况。**"
msgstr "**`values` describes the continuous features of each dimension, so the dimension of `values` must be the same as that of `input`. Note the dimensionality reduction that occurs when the last dimension of `shape` is `1`.**"

msgid "triton.language.multiple_of"
msgstr "triton.language.multiple_of"

msgid "`multiple_of` 用于向编译器声明输入张量中的第一个值是某个数的倍数。"
msgstr "`multiple_of` is used to declare to the compiler that the first value in the input tensor is a multiple of a certain number."

msgid "输入张量，其值都是某个数的倍数"
msgstr "Input tensor, whose values are all multiples of a certain number."

msgid "声明输入值是这些数的倍数（单个整数或按维度的整数序列）"
msgstr "Declare that the input values are multiples of these numbers (a single integer or a sequence of integers by dimension)."

msgid "**`values`描述着每个维度第一个值的可除性特征，所以`values` 的维度要与`input` 的维度相同。 注意当`shape`的最后一维为`1`时出现的降维情况。**"
msgstr "**`values` describes the divisibility characteristics of the first value in each dimension, so the dimension of `values` must be the same as that of `input`. Note the dimensionality reduction that occurs when the last dimension of `shape` is `1`.**"

msgid "triton.language.arange"
msgstr "triton.language.arange"

msgid "简介：`triton.language.arange`函数用于生成一个从`start`到`end`（不包括`end`）的连续整数序列。"
msgstr "Introduction: The `triton.language.arange` function is used to generate a contiguous sequence of integers from `start` to `end` (excluding `end`)."

msgid "`start`"
msgstr "`start`"

msgid "`scalar`"
msgstr "`scalar`"

msgid "创建连续整数序列的起始数值，必须是编译时常量（tl.constexpr）"
msgstr "The starting value for creating a sequence of consecutive integers must be a compile-time constant (tl.constexpr)."

msgid "`end`"
msgstr "`end`"

msgid "创建连续整数序列的结束数值"
msgstr "The end value for creating a sequence of consecutive integers"

msgid "返回值： `tensor`：连续整数序列的tensor"
msgstr "Return value: `tensor`: a tensor of consecutive integer sequences"

msgid "结论：要求arange的参数start、end必须是constant，因此无类型，支持类型对应的值范围，最大到int32，硬件指令也只支持到int32。"
msgstr "Conclusion: The parameters start and end of arange must be constants, hence they are untyped, supporting the value range corresponding to the type, up to int32, and hardware instructions only support up to int32."

msgid "bool/int1"
msgstr "bool/int1"

msgid "Ascend  A2/A3"
msgstr "Ascend A2/A3"

msgid "0 =< (end - start) <1048576 end >= 0,  start  >= 0"
msgstr "0 =< (end - start) < 1048576, end >= 0, start >= 0"

msgid "1.函数用于生成一个[start, end) 的连续整数序列，CUDA要求range=(end-start)必须为2的幂次方。Triton-ascend并无此要求。 2.NV和Triton-ascend都限制end的最大值TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL = 1048576 3.arange的输入必须是constant常量，支持uint、int类型的小于1048576（最大值TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL ）的数值。int64不支持。 4.arange的start 和 end 应大于等于0。"
msgstr "1. The function generates a continuous integer sequence in the range [start, end). CUDA requires that range=(end-start) must be a power of 2. Triton-ascend does not have this requirement. 2. Both NV and Triton-ascend restrict the maximum value of end to TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL = 1048576. 3. The input of arange must be a constant, supporting uint and int type values less than 1048576 (the maximum value TRITON_MAX_TENSOR_NUMEL). int64 is not supported. 4. The start and end of arange should be greater than or equal to 0."

msgid "以下示例实现了生成一个[0, 128) 的连续整数序列："
msgstr "The following example generates a continuous integer sequence from [0, 128):"

msgid "triton.language.cast"
msgstr "triton.language.cast"

msgid "1 功能作用说明"
msgstr "1 Function Description"

msgid "将张量转换为指定的数据类型，支持数值类型转换、位级别重解释（bitcast）、浮点降精度舍入模式，以及Ascend扩展的整数溢出处理模式。"
msgstr "Converts a tensor to the specified data type, supporting numeric type conversion, bit-level reinterpretation (bitcast), floating-point precision reduction rounding modes, and Ascend-extended integer overflow handling modes."

msgid "**语法：**"
msgstr "**Syntax:**"

msgid "`triton.language.cast(input, dtype, fp_downcast_rounding=None, bitcast=False)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.cast(input, dtype, fp_downcast_rounding=None, bitcast=False)` - Function call form"

msgid "`input.cast(dtype, fp_downcast_rounding=None, bitcast=False)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.cast(dtype, fp_downcast_rounding=None, bitcast=False)` - Member function form"

msgid "**功能：**"
msgstr "**Features:**"

msgid "数值类型转换：整型<->整型、浮点<->浮点、整型<->浮点"
msgstr "Numeric type conversion: integer <-> integer, float <-> float, integer <-> float"

msgid "位级别重解释（bitcast）：不改变比特，只改变解释类型"
msgstr "Bit-level reinterpretation (bitcast): does not change the bits, only changes the interpretation type."

msgid "浮点降精度支持舍入模式：`rtne`（默认，四舍六入五成双）、`rtz`（向零）"
msgstr "Floating-point reduction precision supports rounding modes: `rtne` (default, round to nearest, ties to even), `rtz` (toward zero)."

msgid "整数转换（Ascend 扩展）支持溢出模式：`trunc`（截断，默认）、`saturate`（饱和）"
msgstr "Integer conversion (Ascend extension) supports overflow modes: `trunc` (truncation, default), `saturate` (saturation)"

msgid "2 参数规格"
msgstr "2 Parameter Specifications"

msgid "input"
msgstr "input"

msgid "tensor"
msgstr "tensor"

msgid "是"
msgstr "Yes"

msgid "输入张量"
msgstr "input tensor"

msgid "dtype"
msgstr "dtype"

msgid "tl.dtype"
msgstr "tl.dtype"

msgid "目标数据类型"
msgstr "Target data type"

msgid "fp_downcast_rounding"
msgstr "fp_downcast_rounding"

msgid "str"
msgstr "str"

msgid "否"
msgstr "No"

msgid "仅对浮点降精度有效，`rtne` 或 `rtz`"
msgstr "Only effective for floating-point down-conversion precision, `rtne` or `rtz`."

msgid "bitcast"
msgstr "bitcast"

msgid "是否执行位级别重解释，默认 False"
msgstr "Whether to perform bit-level reinterpretation, default False"

msgid "overflow_mode"
msgstr "overflow_mode"

msgid "Ascend 扩展：整数溢出处理，`trunc` 或 `saturate`"
msgstr "Ascend Extension: Integer Overflow Handling, `trunc` or `saturate`"

msgid "**返回值：**"
msgstr "**Return value:**"

msgid "**类型：** tensor"
msgstr "**Type:** tensor"

msgid "**形状：** 与输入张量相同"
msgstr "**Shape:** Same as the input tensor"

msgid "**数据类型：** 与dtype参数指定的目标类型相同"
msgstr "**Data type:** Same as the target type specified by the dtype parameter."

msgid "**内存布局：** 根据bitcast参数决定是否进行位级别重解释"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Determines whether to perform bit-level reinterpretation based on the bitcast parameter."

msgid "**约束条件：**"
msgstr "**Constraints:**"

msgid "`fp_downcast_rounding` 仅在浮点降精度时可设置，否则将报错"
msgstr "`fp_downcast_rounding` can only be set when reducing floating-point precision; otherwise, an error will be reported."

msgid "`bitcast=True` 时不进行数值转换，忽略舍入/溢出模式"
msgstr "When `bitcast=True`, no numerical conversion is performed, and rounding/overflow modes are ignored."

msgid "`overflow_mode` 仅对整型有意义（Ascend 扩展）"
msgstr "`overflow_mode` is only meaningful for integer types (Ascend extension)"

