msgstr "The dimension along which the summation operation is performed. If None, sum over all dimensions."

msgid "如果为True，保持被求和的维度为长度1"
msgstr "If True, keep the summed dimension as length 1."

msgid "返回值： `tensor`：计算输入tensor沿指定轴的元素和，返回求和结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tensor`: Computes the sum of elements of the input tensor along the specified axis, returning the summation result."

msgid "相对社区能力缺失且无法实现 keep_dims=True需要测试更多规格，来确定是否全面支持。目前已测3D dim=2情况下，支持 keep_dims=True。 `dtype` 参数当前版本暂未支持。社区 Triton 3.5.0 中，`dtype` 参数用于控制求和运算的累加数据类型：未指定时，位宽小于 32 的整数类型会自动提升为 `int32`/`uint32` 以避免溢出；显式指定时，输入会先转换为指定类型再执行求和。当前 Triton-Ascend 基于社区 Triton 3.2.0，该类型提升逻辑尚未支持，将在后续升级至 3.5.0 版本时完整支持。"
msgstr "The community lacks the capability and cannot implement `keep_dims=True`. More specifications need to be tested to determine full support. Currently, in the case of 3D dim=2, `keep_dims=True` is supported. The `dtype` parameter is not yet supported in the current version. In community Triton 3.5.0, the `dtype` parameter is used to control the accumulation data type for sum operations: when not specified, integer types with a bit width less than 32 are automatically promoted to `int32`/`uint32` to avoid overflow; when explicitly specified, the input is first converted to the specified type before performing the sum. The current Triton-Ascend is based on community Triton 3.2.0, and this type promotion logic is not yet supported. It will be fully supported in a future upgrade to version 3.5.0."

msgid "以下示例实现了对2Dshape的tensor进行sum运算："
msgstr "The following example implements a sum operation on a 2D shape tensor:"

msgid "triton.language.xor_sum"
msgstr "triton.language.xor_sum"

msgid "简介：`triton.language.xor_sum` 计算输入tensor沿指定轴的异或和，返回异或操作结果。"
msgstr "Introduction: `triton.language.xor_sum` computes the XOR sum of the input tensor along the specified axis and returns the result of the XOR operation."

msgid "沿着哪个维度进行异或和操作。如果为None，则对所有维度进行异或操作"
msgstr "The dimension along which to perform the XOR operation. If None, the XOR operation is performed on all dimensions."

msgid "如果为True，保持被操作的维度为长度1"
msgstr "If True, keep the operated dimension as length 1."

msgid "返回值： `tensor`：输入tensor沿指定轴的异或和，返回异或操作结果"
msgstr "Return value: `tensor`: XOR sum of the input tensor along the specified axis, returns the result of the XOR operation."

msgid "以下示例实现了对2Dshape的tensor进行xor_sum运算："
msgstr "The following example implements the xor_sum operation on a 2D shape tensor:"

msgid "triton.language.associative_scan"
msgstr "triton.language.associative_scan"

msgid "简介：`triton.language.associative_scan` 对输入tensor沿指定轴应用关联扫描操作，使用combine_fn函数组合元素并更新进位值。"
msgstr "Introduction: `triton.language.associative_scan` applies an associative scan operation along a specified axis of the input tensor, using the combine_fn function to combine elements and update the carry value."

msgid "沿着哪个维度进行关联扫描操作"
msgstr "Along which dimension is the correlation scan operation performed"

msgid "`reverse`"
msgstr "`reverse`"

msgid "是否沿轴的反方向应用关联扫描"
msgstr "Whether to apply associative scanning in the opposite direction along the axis"

msgid "返回值： `tensor`：对输入tensor沿指定轴应用关联扫描操作，使用combine_fn函数组合元素并更新进位值之后的tensor。"
msgstr "Return value: `tensor`: The tensor after applying the associative scan operation along the specified axis to the input tensor, using the `combine_fn` function to combine elements and update the carry value."

msgid "相对社区能力缺失且无法实现 reverse=True是否沿轴的反方向应用关联扫描，该功能需要tl.load加载数据时对齐，即不使用mask过滤掉多余数据索引，即如下面示例代码："
msgstr "Relative community capability is missing and unable to achieve reverse=True. Whether to apply associative scanning in the opposite direction along the axis, this feature requires alignment when loading data with tl.load, meaning it does not use mask to filter out redundant data indices, as shown in the example code below:"

msgid "以下示例实现了对2Dshape的tensor进行associative_scan运算："
msgstr "The following example implements associative_scan operation on a 2D shape tensor:"

msgid "triton.language.cumprod"
msgstr "triton.language.cumprod"

msgid "简介：`triton.language.cumprod` 计算输入tensor沿指定轴的累积乘积，返回累积乘积结果。"
msgstr "Introduction: `triton.language.cumprod` computes the cumulative product of the input tensor along the specified axis and returns the cumulative product result."

msgid "沿着哪个维度进行累积乘积操作，默认为0"
msgstr "The dimension along which the cumulative product operation is performed, default is 0."

msgid "如果为True，沿反方向进行累积乘积操作"
msgstr "If True, performs cumulative product operation in the reverse direction."

msgid "`cumprod` 函数计算沿指定轴的累积乘积（前缀乘积）。例如，对于输入 `[a, b, c, d]`，累积乘积结果为 `[a, a*b, a*b*c, a*b*c*d]`。"
msgstr "The `cumprod` function computes the cumulative product (prefix product) along a specified axis. For example, for the input `[a, b, c, d]`, the cumulative product result is `[a, a*b, a*b*c, a*b*c*d]`."

msgid "当 `reverse=True` 时，计算反向累积乘积：`[a*b*c*d, b*c*d, c*d, d]`。"
msgstr "When `reverse=True`, compute the reverse cumulative product: `[a*b*c*d, b*c*d, c*d, d]`."

msgid "与 `cumsum` 不同，`cumprod` 没有 `dtype` 参数，因此在使用时需要注意数据类型的溢出问题，特别是对于整数类型的累积乘积。"
msgstr "Unlike `cumsum`, `cumprod` does not have a `dtype` parameter, so attention must be paid to data type overflow issues when using it, especially for cumulative products of integer types."

msgid "以下示例实现了对2Dshape的tensor进行cumprod运算："
msgstr "The following example implements the cumprod operation on a 2D shape tensor:"

msgid "triton.language.cumsum"
msgstr "triton.language.cumsum"

msgid "简介：`triton.language.cumsum` 计算输入tensor沿指定轴的累积和，返回累积求和结果。"
msgstr "Introduction: `triton.language.cumsum` computes the cumulative sum of the input tensor along the specified axis and returns the cumulative summation result."

msgid "沿着哪个维度进行累积和操作，默认为0"
msgstr "The dimension along which the cumulative sum operation is performed, default is 0."

msgid "如果为True，沿反方向进行累积和操作"
msgstr "If True, perform cumulative sum operation in the reverse direction."

msgid "`cumsum` 函数计算沿指定轴的累积和（前缀和）。例如，对于输入 `[a, b, c, d]`，累积和结果为 `[a, a+b, a+b+c, a+b+c+d]`。"
msgstr "The `cumsum` function computes the cumulative sum (prefix sum) along a specified axis. For example, for the input `[a, b, c, d]`, the cumulative sum result is `[a, a+b, a+b+c, a+b+c+d]`."

msgid "当 `reverse=True` 时，计算反向累积和：`[a+b+c+d, b+c+d, c+d, d]`。"
msgstr "When `reverse=True`, compute the reverse cumulative sum: `[a+b+c+d, b+c+d, c+d, d]`."

msgid "返回值： `tensor`：计算输入tensor沿指定轴的累积和，返回累积求和结果。"
msgstr "Return value: `tensor`: Computes the cumulative sum of the input tensor along the specified axis, returning the cumulative summation result."

msgid "以下示例实现了对2Dshape的tensor进行cumsum运算："
msgstr "The following example implements the cumsum operation on a 2D shape tensor:"

msgid "triton.language.histogram"
msgstr "triton.language.histogram"

msgid "简介：基于 input 计算 1 个具有 num_bins 个 bin 的直方图，每个 bin 宽度为 1，起始于 0。 原型："
msgstr "Introduction: Computes a histogram with num_bins bins based on input, where each bin has a width of 1, starting from 0. Prototype:"

msgid "可以作为tensor的成员函数调用，如`x.histogram(...)`，与`histogram(x, ...)`等效。"
msgstr "Can be called as a member function of a tensor, such as `x.histogram(...)`, which is equivalent to `histogram(x, ...)`."

msgid "输入数据，包含需要统计分布的所有数值点"
msgstr "Input data, containing all numerical points for which the distribution needs to be calculated."

msgid "`num_bins`"
msgstr "`num_bins`"

msgid "定义要将整个数据范围划分成多少个等宽的区间"
msgstr "Define how many equal-width intervals the entire data range should be divided into."

msgid "返回值： 用tensor表示的直方图 注：当前triton3.2版本暂未支持mask，待版本更新后支持；input输入范围限制在[0,num_bins-1]中，待版本更新后支持全范围"
msgstr "Return value: histogram represented by tensor. Note: The current Triton 3.2 version does not yet support mask; support will be added in a future version update. The input range is limited to [0, num_bins-1]; full range support will be added in a future version update."

msgid "目前仅支持一维"
msgstr "Currently only one-dimensional is supported."

msgid "以下示例实现了histogram的调用："
msgstr "The following example demonstrates the invocation of histogram:"

msgid "扫描/排序操作"
msgstr "Scan/Sort Operation"

msgid "[associative_scan](./associative_scan.md)"
msgstr "[associative_scan](./associative_scan.md)"

msgid "沿指定 axis 将 combine_fn 应用于 input 张量的每个元素和携带的值，并更新携带的值"
msgstr "Apply combine_fn to each element of the input tensor along the specified axis and the carried value, updating the carried value."

msgid "[cumprod](./cumprod.md)"
msgstr "[cumprod](./cumprod.md)"

msgid "返回沿指定 axis 的 input 张量中所有元素的累积乘积"
msgstr "Returns the cumulative product of all elements in the input tensor along the specified axis."

msgid "[cumsum](./cumsum.md)"
msgstr "[cumsum](./cumsum.md)"

msgid "返回沿指定 axis 的 input 张量中所有元素的累积和"
msgstr "Returns the cumulative sum of all elements in the input tensor along the specified axis."

msgid "[histogram](./histogram.md)"
msgstr "[histogram](./histogram.md)"

msgid "基于 input 张量计算 1 个具有 num_bins 个 bin 的直方图，每个 bin 宽度为 1，起始于 0"
msgstr "Compute a histogram with num_bins bins based on the input tensor, where each bin has a width of 1 and starts at 0."

msgid "[sort](./sort.md)"
msgstr "[sort](./sort.md)"

msgid "沿着指定维度对张量进行排序"
msgstr "Sorts the tensor along the specified dimension."

msgid "[topk](./topk.md)"
msgstr "[topk](./topk.md)"

msgid "返回沿指定维度的前 k 个最大元素"
msgstr "Returns the top k largest elements along the specified dimension."

msgid "triton.language.sort"
msgstr "triton.language.sort"

msgid "简介：对输入张量`x`按维度进行升序或者降序的排序。"
msgstr "Introduction: Sort the input tensor `x` in ascending or descending order along a specified dimension."

msgid "排序维度"
msgstr "Sorting dimension"

msgid "`descending`"
msgstr "`descending`"

msgid "是否降序"
msgstr "Whether descending order"

msgid "结论：Ascend 相比 GPU 缺失 int32、uint8、int64、float64、bool 支持。 torch_npu支持uint8。"
msgstr "Conclusion: Compared to GPU, Ascend lacks support for int32, uint8, int64, float64, and bool. torch_npu supports uint8."

msgid "毕升编译器限制，int32、uint8、int64、float64、bool 无法实现。"
msgstr "Bisheng compiler limitation: int32, uint8, int64, float64, and bool cannot be implemented."

msgid "以下示例实现了对输入张量 `x` 做排序："
msgstr "The following example demonstrates sorting the input tensor `x`:"

msgid "triton.language.topk"
msgstr "triton.language.topk"

msgid "简介：返回输入张量 `x` 沿指定维度的前 `k` 个最大元素，返回结果按从大到小排序。"
msgstr "Introduction: Returns the top `k` largest elements of the input tensor `x` along the specified dimension, with the results sorted in descending order."

msgid "`k`"
msgstr "`k`"

msgid "要返回的top元素数量，必须是 2 的幂"
msgstr "The number of top elements to return must be a power of 2."

msgid "`constexpr int` 或 `None`"
msgstr "`constexpr int` or `None`"

msgid "要查找 top k 元素的维度；该参数需要在编译期确定；如果为 `None`，则使用最后一个维度；当前仅支持最后一个维度"
msgstr "To find the dimension of the top k elements; this parameter must be determined at compile time; if `None`, the last dimension is used; currently only the last dimension is supported."

msgid "返回值： `out`：输出张量的 shape 与输入张量一致，但指定维度长度变为 `k`"
msgstr "Return value: `out`: The shape of the output tensor is the same as the input tensor, but the length of the specified dimension becomes `k`."

msgid "结论：Ascend 相比 GPU 缺失 int32、uint8、int64、float64、bool 支持。 torch_npu 支持 uint8。"
msgstr "Conclusion: Compared to GPU, Ascend lacks support for int32, uint8, int64, float64, and bool. torch_npu supports uint8."

msgid "仅支持 1~5 维 tensor"
msgstr "Only supports 1 to 5 dimensional tensors."

msgid "当前 `topk` 仅返回最大值，不支持通过参数切换为返回最小值。 `dim` 仅支持最后一个维度。 `k` 必须为 2 的幂。"
msgstr "Currently `topk` only returns the maximum values and does not support switching to return the minimum values via parameters. `dim` only supports the last dimension. `k` must be a power of 2."

msgid "以下示例实现了对输入张量 `x` 沿最后一个维度取前 `k` 个最大元素："
msgstr "The following example implements taking the top `k` largest elements along the last dimension of the input tensor `x`:"

msgid "triton.language.broadcast"
msgstr "triton.language.broadcast"

msgid "将两个张量广播到共同兼容的形状，使它们可以进行逐元素操作。"
msgstr "Broadcasts two tensors to a common compatible shape so that they can perform element-wise operations."

msgid "`triton.language.broadcast(input, other)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.broadcast(input, other)` - function call form"

msgid "自动对齐不同秩张量得到目标形状"
msgstr "Automatically align tensors of different ranks to obtain the target shape."

msgid "将大小为1的维度扩展到目标形状中对应维度的大小"
msgstr "Expand the dimension of size 1 to the size of the corresponding dimension in the target shape."

msgid "第一个输入张量，必须为RankedTensorType"
msgstr "The first input tensor must be of type RankedTensorType."

msgid "other"
msgstr "other"

msgid "第二个输入张量，必须为RankedTensorType"
msgstr "The second input tensor must be of type RankedTensorType."

msgid "**形状：** 两个tensor共同兼容的目标形状"
msgstr "**Shape:** The target shape that two tensors are compatible with."

msgid "**数据类型：** 每个返回的张量保持其输入的原始数据类型"
msgstr "**Data Type:** Each returned tensor retains the original data type of its input."

msgid "**内存布局：**返回新创建的张量"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Returns the newly created tensor."

msgid "triton.language.broadcast_to"
msgstr "triton.language.broadcast_to"

msgid "将张量广播到目标形状，自动处理维度对齐。广播操作不会复制数据，而是通过改变张量的形状和步长来实现。"
msgstr "Broadcast the tensor to the target shape, automatically handling dimension alignment. The broadcasting operation does not copy data but instead achieves it by altering the tensor's shape and stride."

msgid "`triton.language.broadcast_to(input, shape)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.broadcast_to(input, shape)` - function call form"

msgid "`input.broadcast_to(shape)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.broadcast_to(shape)` - member function form"

msgid "自动处理维度对齐，将大小为1的维度扩展到目标形状中对应维度的大小"
msgstr "Automatically handle dimension alignment, expanding dimensions of size 1 to the corresponding dimension size in the target shape."

msgid "保持数据不变，仅改变张量的形状信息"
msgstr "Keep the data unchanged, only change the shape information of the tensor."

msgid "shape"
msgstr "shape"

msgid "List[int]"
msgstr "List[int]"

msgid "目标形状"
msgstr "Target shape"

msgid "**形状：** 与shape参数指定的目标形状相同"
msgstr "**Shape:** Same as the target shape specified by the shape parameter."

msgid "**数据类型：** 与输入张量相同"
msgstr "**Data type:** Same as the input tensor"

msgid "**内存布局：** 通过改变步长信息实现广播，无数据拷贝"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Broadcasting is achieved by changing stride information without data copying."

msgid "输入张量的维度数必须等于目标形状的维度数"
msgstr "The number of dimensions of the input tensor must equal the number of dimensions of the target shape."

msgid "所有维度必须满足广播规则"
msgstr "All dimensions must satisfy the broadcasting rules."

msgid "与broadcast不同，Triton社区实现的broadcast_to必须保证tensor的shape和目标shape的rank一致"
msgstr "Unlike broadcast, the broadcast_to implemented by the Triton community must ensure that the rank of the tensor's shape matches the rank of the target shape."

msgid "triton.language.expand_dims"
msgstr "triton.language.expand_dims"

msgid "在指定轴位置插入大小为1的维度，不改变张量的数据，仅增加维度数。支持负索引，从右向左计数。"
msgstr "Inserts a dimension of size 1 at the specified axis position, without changing the tensor data, only increasing the number of dimensions. Supports negative indexing, counting from right to left."

msgid "`triton.language.expand_dims(input, axis)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.expand_dims(input, axis)` - Function call form"

msgid "`input.expand_dims(axis)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.expand_dims(axis)` - member function form"

msgid "在指定轴位置插入大小为1的维度"
msgstr "Insert a dimension of size 1 at the specified axis position."

msgid "不改变张量的数据，仅增加维度数"
msgstr "Without changing the tensor's data, only increase the number of dimensions."

msgid "支持负索引，从右向左计数"
msgstr "Supports negative indexing, counting from right to left."

msgid "int | Tuple[int]"
msgstr "int | Tuple[int]"

msgid "插入维度的位置，支持负索引"
msgstr "Position to insert the dimension, supports negative indexing."

msgid "**形状：** 在指定axis位置插入大小为1的维度"
msgstr "**Shape:** Insert a dimension of size 1 at the specified axis position."

msgid "**内存布局：** 通过tensor::ExpandShapeOp实现，无数据拷贝"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Implemented via `tensor::ExpandShapeOp`, no data copy."

msgid "axis必须在[-rank-1, rank]范围内，其中rank为输入张量的维度数"
msgstr "axis must be in the range [-rank-1, rank], where rank is the number of dimensions of the input tensor."

msgid "插入的维度大小固定为1"
msgstr "The inserted dimension size is fixed at 1."

msgid "triton.language.interleave"
msgstr "triton.language.interleave"

msgid "将两个相同形状的输入张量在最后一个维度上交错排列，输出张量的最后一个维度大小为输入张量的2倍，其他维度保持不变。"
msgstr "Interleave two input tensors of the same shape along the last dimension, resulting in an output tensor whose last dimension size is twice that of the input tensors, while keeping other dimensions unchanged."

msgid "`triton.language.interleave(x, y)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.interleave(x, y)` - function call form"

msgid "`x.interleave(y)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`x.interleave(y)` - member function form"

msgid "将两个相同形状的输入张量在最后一个维度上交错排列"
msgstr "Interleave two input tensors of the same shape along the last dimension."

msgid "输出张量的最后一个维度大小为输入张量的2倍"
msgstr "The last dimension size of the output tensor is twice that of the input tensor."

msgid "其他维度保持不变"
msgstr "Other dimensions remain unchanged."

msgid "x"
msgstr "x"

msgid "第一个输入张量"
msgstr "The first input tensor"

msgid "y"
msgstr "y"

msgid "第二个输入张量，形状必须与x相同"
msgstr "The second input tensor must have the same shape as x."

msgid "**形状：** 输入形状的最后一个维度乘以2"
msgstr "**Shape:** The last dimension of the input shape multiplied by 2"

msgid "**内存布局：** 交替排列x和y的元素"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Interleaved arrangement of x and y elements"

msgid "两个输入张量必须具有相同的形状和数据类型"
msgstr "Two input tensors must have the same shape and data type."

msgid "输出张量的形状为输入形状的最后一个维度乘以2"
msgstr "The shape of the output tensor is the last dimension of the input shape multiplied by 2."

msgid "triton.language.join"
msgstr "triton.language.join"

msgid "将两个相同形状的输入张量沿着新的最小维度连接，输出张量比输入张量多一个维度，大小为2，保持其他维度不变。"
msgstr "Concatenate two input tensors of the same shape along a new minimum dimension. The output tensor has one more dimension than the input tensors, with a size of 2, while keeping other dimensions unchanged."

msgid "`triton.language.join(x, y)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.join(x, y)` - Function call form"

msgid "`x.join(y)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`x.join(y)` - member function form"

msgid "将两个相同形状的输入张量沿着新的最小维度连接"
msgstr "Concatenates two input tensors of the same shape along a new minimum dimension."

msgid "输出张量比输入张量多一个维度，大小为2"
msgstr "The output tensor has one more dimension than the input tensor, with a size of 2."

msgid "保持其他维度不变"
msgstr "Keep other dimensions unchanged."

msgid "第二个输入张量"
msgstr "The second input tensor"

msgid "**形状：** 输入tensor广播后的形状加上一个大小为2的维度"
msgstr "**Shape:** The broadcasted shape of the input tensor plus a dimension of size 2."

msgid "**内存布局：** 在新增维度上堆叠x和y"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Stack x and y on the new dimension."

msgid "两个输入张量必须具有可以广播到相同形状的形状和数据类型"
msgstr "The two input tensors must have shapes and data types that can be broadcast to the same shape."

msgid "triton.language.permute"
msgstr "triton.language.permute"

msgid "根据dims参数重新排列张量的维度，不改变张量的数据，仅改变维度的顺序。支持任意维度的重新排列。"
msgstr "Rearranges the dimensions of a tensor according to the `dims` parameter, without changing the tensor's data, only the order of dimensions. Supports rearrangement of any number of dimensions."

msgid "`triton.language.permute(input, dims)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.permute(input, dims)` - function call form"

msgid "`input.permute(dims)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.permute(dims)` - member function form"

msgid "根据dims参数重新排列张量的维度"
msgstr "Rearrange the dimensions of the tensor according to the `dims` parameter."

msgid "不改变张量的数据，仅改变维度的顺序"
msgstr "Without changing the tensor's data, only altering the order of dimensions."

msgid "支持任意维度的重新排列"
msgstr "Supports rearrangement of any dimension."

msgid "dims"
msgstr "dims"

msgid "新的维度顺序"
msgstr "New dimension order"

msgid "**形状：** 按照dims参数重新排列的维度"
msgstr "**Shape:** Dimensions rearranged according to the `dims` parameter."

msgid "**内存布局：** 通过改变步长信息实现转置，无数据拷贝"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Transposition is achieved by changing stride information, with no data copy."

msgid "dims必须包含输入张量的所有维度索引"
msgstr "dims must contain all dimension indices of the input tensor"

msgid "支持任意维度数和任意形状大小。"
msgstr "Supports any number of dimensions and any shape size."

msgid "不支持维度高于8的转置"
msgstr "Transposition for dimensions higher than 8 is not supported."

msgid "triton.language.ravel"
msgstr "triton.language.ravel"

msgid "将输入张量展平为一维张量，保持元素在内存中的顺序，输出张量的总元素数与输入张量相同。"
msgstr "Flatten the input tensor into a one-dimensional tensor, preserving the order of elements in memory. The total number of elements in the output tensor is the same as that of the input tensor."

msgid "`triton.language.ravel(input)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.ravel(input)` - Function call form"

msgid "`input.ravel()` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.ravel()` - member function form"

msgid "将输入张量展平为一维张量"
msgstr "Flatten the input tensor into a one-dimensional tensor."

msgid "保持元素在内存中的顺序"
msgstr "Maintain the order of elements in memory"

msgid "输出张量的总元素数与输入张量相同"
msgstr "The total number of elements in the output tensor is the same as that in the input tensor."

msgid "**形状：** 一维张量，包含输入张量的所有元素"
msgstr "**Shape:** A one-dimensional tensor containing all elements of the input tensor."

msgid "**内存布局：** 按行优先顺序展平"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Flattened in row-major order"

msgid "无特殊约束，支持任意形状的输入"
msgstr "No special constraints, supports input of arbitrary shapes."

msgid "triton.language.reshape"
msgstr "triton.language.reshape"

msgid "将张量重新解释为新的形状。"
msgstr "Reinterprets a tensor as a new shape."

msgid "`triton.language.reshape(input, shape, can_reorder=False)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.reshape(input, shape, can_reorder=False)` - Function call form"

msgid "`input.reshape(shape, can_reorder=False)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.reshape(shape, can_reorder=False)` - Member function form"

msgid "将张量重新解释为新的形状"
msgstr "Reinterpret the tensor as a new shape."

msgid "can_reorder"
msgstr "can_reorder"

msgid "是否允许重新排序元素，默认False"
msgstr "Whether reordering elements is allowed, default is False."

msgid "**内存布局：** 根据can_reorder参数决定"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Determined by the `can_reorder` parameter"

msgid "输入和输出张量的总元素数必须相等"
msgstr "The total number of elements in the input and output tensors must be equal."

msgid "所有tensor不允许某个shape的size小于1"
msgstr "All tensors do not allow a shape with a size less than 1."

msgid "can_reorder参数仅支持False"
msgstr "The `can_reorder` parameter only supports False."

msgid "triton.language.split"
msgstr "triton.language.split"

msgid "将输入张量沿着最后一个维度分割成两个张量，输出张量的最后一个维度大小为输入张量的一半，其他维度保持不变。"
msgstr "Split the input tensor along the last dimension into two tensors, where the last dimension size of the output tensors is half of the input tensor, while the other dimensions remain unchanged."

msgid "`triton.language.split(input)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.split(input)` - function call form"

msgid "`input.split()` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.split()` - member function form"

msgid "将输入张量沿着最后一个维度分割成两个张量"
msgstr "Split the input tensor into two tensors along the last dimension."

msgid "输出张量的最后一个维度大小为输入张量的一半，最后一个维度的大小必须为2"
msgstr "The size of the last dimension of the output tensor is half that of the input tensor, and the size of the last dimension must be 2."

msgid "**类型：** Tuple[tensor, tensor]"
msgstr "**Type:** Tuple[tensor, tensor]"

msgid "**形状：** 两个张量，形状相同，最后一个维度为输入的一半"
msgstr "**Shape:** Two tensors with the same shape, where the last dimension is half of the input."

msgid "**内存布局：** 分别包含输入张量的奇数和偶数位置元素"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Contains the odd and even position elements of the input tensor respectively."

msgid "输入张量的最后一个维度大小必须为偶数"
msgstr "The last dimension size of the input tensor must be an even number."

msgid "输出两个张量，形状相同"
msgstr "Output two tensors with the same shape."

msgid "triton.language.trans"
msgstr "triton.language.trans"

msgid "根据dims参数转置张量的维度，不改变张量的数据，仅改变维度的顺序。专门优化的转置操作。"
msgstr "Transposes the dimensions of a tensor according to the `dims` parameter, without changing the tensor's data, only altering the order of dimensions. A specially optimized transpose operation."

msgid "`triton.language.trans(input, dims)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.trans(input, dims)` - function call form"

msgid "`input.trans(dims)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.trans(dims)` - member function form"

msgid "根据dims参数转置张量的维度"
msgstr "Transpose the dimensions of a tensor according to the `dims` parameter."

msgid "专门优化的转置操作"
msgstr "Specially optimized transpose operation"

msgid "转置后的维度顺序"
msgstr "The dimension order after transposition"

msgid "triton.language.view"
msgstr "triton.language.view"

msgid "创建张量的视图，改变形状但不复制数据，类似于reshape，但更强调视图的概念，保持数据在内存中的连续性。"
msgstr "Create a view of a tensor, changing the shape without copying data, similar to `reshape`, but with a stronger emphasis on the concept of a view, maintaining data continuity in memory."

msgid "`triton.language.view(input, shape)` - 函数调用形式"
msgstr "`triton.language.view(input, shape)` - Function call form"

msgid "`input.view(shape)` - 成员函数形式"
msgstr "`input.view(shape)` - member function form"

msgid "创建张量的视图，改变形状但不复制数据"
msgstr "Create a view of a tensor, changing the shape without copying the data."

msgid "类似于reshape，但更强调视图的概念"
msgstr "Similar to reshape, but with a stronger emphasis on the concept of views."

msgid "保持数据在内存中的连续性"
msgstr "Maintain data continuity in memory"

msgid "**内存布局：** 与输入张量在内存中连续"
msgstr "**Memory Layout:** Contiguous in memory with the input tensor"

msgid "输出张量必须与输入张量在内存中连续"
msgstr "The output tensor must be contiguous in memory with the input tensor."

