msgid "al.copy_from_ub_to_l1 接口文档"
msgstr "al.copy_from_ub_to_l1 API Documentation"

msgid "1. 硬件背景"
msgstr "1. Hardware Background"

msgid "昇腾硬件 A5 支持了直接从 UB 复制数据到 L1 ， 避免了先从 UB 到 GM 再从 GM 到 L1 复制两次，可以提高数据复制的效率。 因此，提供 copy_from_ub_to_l1 接口实现数据从 UB 到 L1 的复制。"
msgstr "Ascend hardware A5 supports direct data copy from UB to L1, avoiding the two-step copy process from UB to GM and then from GM to L1, thereby improving data copy efficiency. Therefore, the `copy_from_ub_to_l1` interface is provided to implement data copy from UB to L1."

