msgstr "Supplementary explanation: When using `sizes` and `strides`, the input type should be `List[tl.constexpr]` (note: do not mistakenly pass a tensor, otherwise an error will occur due to type mismatch). For `offsets`, support for tensor input has been added (constexpr can also be passed)."

