msgid "面向分离模式的核间同步控制接口。"
msgstr "Inter-core synchronous control interface for separation mode."

msgid "该接口和 sync_block_wait 接口配合使用。使用时需传入核间同步的标记ID(flagId)，每个ID对应一个初始值为0的计数器。执行CrossCoreSetFlag后ID对应的计数器增加1；执行CrossCoreWaitFlag时如果对应的计数器数值为0则阻塞不执行；如果对应的计数器大于0，则计数器减一，同时后续指令开始执行。"
msgstr "This interface is used in conjunction with the `sync_block_wait` interface. When using it, the inter-core synchronization flag ID (flagId) must be passed in, where each ID corresponds to a counter with an initial value of 0. After executing `CrossCoreSetFlag`, the counter corresponding to the ID increments by 1; when executing `CrossCoreWaitFlag`, if the corresponding counter value is 0, it blocks and does not execute; if the corresponding counter is greater than 0, the counter decrements by 1, and subsequent instructions begin execution."

