msgid "triton_launch_kernel"
msgstr "triton_launch_kernel"

msgid "1. 接口概述"
msgstr "1. Interface Overview"

msgid "`triton_launch_kernel` 是 Ascend 后端 launcher stub 动态库（`.so`）中导出的 C 语言运行时接口，用于在已通过 CANN runtime 注册 kernel function handle 后，直接发射（launch）Triton 算子到 NPU 上执行。"
msgstr "`triton_launch_kernel` is the C language runtime interface exported from the Ascend backend launcher stub dynamic library (`.so`), used to directly launch the Triton operator onto the NPU for execution after the kernel function handle has been registered via the CANN runtime."

msgid "该接口以 `extern \"C\"` 方式导出，与标准 Python JIT 调用路径（`@triton.jit` → `kernel[grid](...)`）**并列独立**——普通用户通过 `@triton.jit` 调用时不经过此函数；它面向的是需要 C 级别 kernel 发射能力的高级场景，如自定义部署流水线、推理引擎集成、同签名 kernel 复用等。"
msgstr "This interface is exported via `extern \"C\"` and exists **independently in parallel** with the standard Python JIT invocation path (`@triton.jit` → `kernel[grid](...)`) — ordinary users calling through `@triton.jit` do not go through this function; it is intended for advanced scenarios requiring C-level kernel launch capabilities, such as custom deployment pipelines, inference engine integration, and reuse of kernels with the same signature."

msgid "每个 JIT 编译产物（launcher stub `.so`）中均包含一份由 `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` 动态生成的 `triton_launch_kernel`，其参数区内存布局受 kernel signature、metadata（workspace / syncBlockLock / coalesce）、device_print、ffts 等因素共同影响。调用方应注意不同编译产物之间的布局差异（详见[第 8 章](#8-限制与注意事项)）。"
msgstr "Each JIT compilation artifact (launcher stub `.so`) contains a `triton_launch_kernel` dynamically generated by `generate_npu_wrapper_src()`. The memory layout of its parameter region is jointly influenced by factors such as the kernel signature, metadata (workspace / syncBlockLock / coalesce), device_print, and ffts. Callers should be aware of layout differences between different compilation artifacts (see [Chapter 8](#8-limitations-and-precautions) for details)."

msgid "2. 函数签名"
msgstr "2. Function Signature"

msgid "输入/输出"
msgstr "Input/Output"

msgid "`kernelName`"
msgstr "`kernelName`"

msgid "`const char*`"
msgstr "`const char*`"

msgid "kernel 名称字符串，用于日志和 profiling 标识"
msgstr "kernel name string, used for logging and profiling identification"

msgid "`func`"
msgstr "`func`"

