msgstr "**CANN runtime registered kernel function handle**. The caller must first complete registration via `rtDevBinaryRegister` / `rtFunctionRegister`, and must not directly pass raw `.aocx` file data."

msgid "`rtStream_t`"
msgstr "`rtStream_t`"

msgid "CANN 运行时 stream 句柄，kernel 将在此 stream 上执行"
msgstr "CANN runtime stream handle, the kernel will be executed on this stream."

