msgstr "The size (in bytes) of each kernel parameter corresponds one-to-one with `kernel_args`, and the array length equals `num_args`. If `num_args` is 0, it can be `nullptr`."

msgid "`num_args`"
msgstr "`num_args`"

msgid "kernel 参数个数。若 `num_args > 0` 但 `kernel_args` 或 `arg_sizes` 为 `nullptr`，函数将静默返回，不发射 kernel"
msgstr "Number of kernel parameters. If `num_args > 0` but `kernel_args` or `arg_sizes` is `nullptr`, the function will silently return without launching the kernel."

msgid "4. 参数内存布局与生命周期"
msgstr "4. Parameter Memory Layout and Lifecycle"

msgid "4.1 kernel_args 深拷贝"
msgstr "4.1 Deep Copy of kernel_args"

msgid "函数内部会遍历 `kernel_args` 和 `arg_sizes`，将每个参数值 `memcpy` 到 `std::vector<std::vector<char>> copied_kernel_args` 本地容器中。因此："
msgstr "Inside the function, it iterates through `kernel_args` and `arg_sizes`, and `memcpy`s each argument value into a local container `std::vector<std::vector<char>> copied_kernel_args`. Therefore:"

msgid "**调用方在函数返回后可立即释放 `kernel_args` 中各指针指向的内存**，不影响发射"
msgstr "**The caller can immediately free the memory pointed to by each pointer in `kernel_args` after the function returns**, without affecting the launch."

msgid "深拷贝带来额外内存开销，开销大小 = `sum(arg_sizes[i])`"
msgstr "Deep copy introduces additional memory overhead, where the overhead size = `sum(arg_sizes[i])`."

msgid "4.2 launch_args 连续缓冲区布局"
msgstr "4.2 launch_args contiguous buffer layout"

msgid "函数内部将所有发射参数组装到一段连续的 `std::vector<char> launch_args` 中，按以下顺序布局（各槽位按对齐要求偏移）："
msgstr "Inside the function, all launch parameters are assembled into a contiguous `std::vector<char> launch_args`, laid out in the following order (each slot is offset according to alignment requirements):"

msgid "**注意：** 此布局由 `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` 根据当前 kernel 的 signature、metadata、编译选项动态生成，不同编译产物的布局可能不同。"
msgstr "**Note:** This layout is dynamically generated by `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` based on the current kernel's signature, metadata, and compilation options. The layout may vary across different compilation artifacts."

msgid "4.3 workspace 与 syncBlockLock"
msgstr "4.3 workspace and syncBlockLock"

msgid "**workspace**：当 `metadata.workspace_size > 0` 时，函数内部通过 `allocate_memory` 分配 workspace，并以 `std::shared_ptr` 管理生命周期，函数返回时自动释放"
msgstr "**workspace**: When `metadata.workspace_size > 0`, the function allocates workspace via `allocate_memory` and manages its lifecycle with `std::shared_ptr`, automatically releasing it upon function return."

msgid "**syncBlockLock**：当 `metadata.lock_num > 0` 时，函数内部通过 `allocate_sync_block_lock` 分配同步锁内存，初始化值为 `metadata.lock_init_value`，同样以 `std::shared_ptr` 管理生命周期"
msgstr "**syncBlockLock**: When `metadata.lock_num > 0`, the function internally allocates synchronization lock memory via `allocate_sync_block_lock`, with the initial value set to `metadata.lock_init_value`, and also manages its lifecycle using `std::shared_ptr`."

msgid "分配失败时向 stderr 输出错误信息并直接 `return`，不抛出异常"
msgstr "Output error information to stderr on allocation failure and directly `return`, without throwing an exception."

