msgid "6. 最小调用示例"
msgstr "6. Minimum Call Example"

msgid "6.1 C/C++ 示例（已有 func 句柄后）"
msgstr "6.1 C/C++ Example (After Having the func Handle)"

msgid "以下示例假设调用方已通过 CANN runtime 完成 kernel binary 的注册并持有可用的 `func` handle，仅展示调用 `triton_launch_kernel` 的参数组织方式。kernel 注册流程（`rtDevBinaryRegister` / `rtFunctionRegister`）属于 CANN runtime 标准流程，不在本示例范围内。"
msgstr "The following example assumes that the caller has registered the kernel binary via the CANN runtime and holds an available `func` handle, only demonstrating the parameter organization for calling `triton_launch_kernel`. The kernel registration process (`rtDevBinaryRegister` / `rtFunctionRegister`) is part of the standard CANN runtime workflow and is not within the scope of this example."

msgid "**说明：** 示例中的 `func` 参数是 CANN runtime 注册后的 kernel function handle，获取方式（`rtDevBinaryRegister` / `rtFunctionRegister`）属于 CANN runtime 标准流程。当前仓内 `npu_utils.cpp` 中的 `loadKernelBinary` / `registerKernel` 函数提供了 Python 侧的封装实现，具体 API 签名请以 CANN 头文件（`runtime/kernel.h`）为准。关于这些辅助函数是否可作为公开 API 文档化，请参见[待确认事项](#待确认事项)。"
msgstr "**Note:** The `func` parameter in the example is the kernel function handle registered by the CANN runtime. The method to obtain it (`rtDevBinaryRegister` / `rtFunctionRegister`) follows the standard CANN runtime procedure. The `loadKernelBinary` / `registerKernel` functions in the current repository's `npu_utils.cpp` provide Python-side wrapper implementations. For specific API signatures, refer to the CANN header file (`runtime/kernel.h`). Regarding whether these helper functions can be documented as public APIs, please see [Pending Confirmation](#待确认事项)."

msgid "6.2 Python ctypes 示例"
msgstr "6.2 Python ctypes Example"

msgid "通过 ctypes 直接调用 launcher stub 中的 `triton_launch_kernel`："
msgstr "Directly call `triton_launch_kernel` in the launcher stub via ctypes."

msgid "6.3 标准 Python JIT 间接调用（对照）"
msgstr "6.3 Standard Python JIT Indirect Call (Comparison)"

msgid "多数用户无需直接调用 `triton_launch_kernel`，使用标准 `@triton.jit` 即可："
msgstr "Most users do not need to directly call `triton_launch_kernel`; using the standard `@triton.jit` is sufficient."

msgid "7. 环境变量影响"
msgstr "7. Environment Variable Influence"

msgid "以下环境变量影响 `triton_launch_kernel` 的运行时行为。默认值以 `release/3.2.2` 分支源码为准。"
msgstr "The following environment variables affect the runtime behavior of `triton_launch_kernel`. The default values are based on the source code of the `release/3.2.2` branch."

msgid "源码位置"
msgstr "Source code location"

msgid "影响"
msgstr "Impact"

msgid "`TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY`"
msgstr "`TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY`"

msgid "`\"false\"`"
msgstr "`\"false\"`"

msgid "`driver.py:109`"
msgstr "`driver.py:109`"

msgid "为 `\"true\"` 时跳过 kernel 发射，仅编译"
msgstr "When set to `\"true\"`, skip kernel launch and only compile."

msgid "`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`"

msgid "`driver.py:452-453`"
msgstr "`driver.py:452-453`"

msgid "为 `\"true\"` 时启用 device printf，影响 launch_args 中 DTData 槽位的有无和 CANN DebugTunnel 的开关"
msgstr "When set to `\"true\"`, device printf is enabled, affecting the presence of the DTData slot in launch_args and the switch of CANN DebugTunnel."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE`"

msgid "`\"true\"`"
msgstr "`\"true\"`"

msgid "`driver.py:454-455`"
msgstr "`driver.py:454-455`"

msgid "为 `\"true\"` 时启用异步 TaskQueue 模式，函数提交任务后立即返回；为 `\"false\"` 时同步等待 kernel 执行完成"
msgstr "When set to `\"true\"`, the asynchronous TaskQueue mode is enabled, and the function returns immediately after submitting the task; when set to `\"false\"`, it synchronously waits for the kernel execution to complete."

msgid "`TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT`"

msgid "`driver.py:456-457`"
msgstr "`driver.py:456-457`"

msgid "为 `\"true\"` 时，若 `blockNum` 超过物理核数则向 stderr 输出性能警告"
msgstr "When set to `\"true\"`, if `blockNum` exceeds the number of physical cores, a performance warning is output to stderr."

msgid "**注意：** 以上默认值仅在 `release/3.2.2` 分支中验证。其他分支或版本可能有不同默认值，请以实际源码为准。"
msgstr "**Note:** The above default values have only been validated in the `release/3.2.2` branch. Other branches or versions may have different default values; please refer to the actual source code."

msgid "8. 限制与注意事项"
msgstr "8. Limitations and Precautions"

msgid "平台限制"
msgstr "Platform Restrictions"

msgid "仅支持昇腾 NPU 平台（Atlas A2/A3 系列），不支持 GPU"
msgstr "Only supports Ascend NPU platforms (Atlas A2/A3 series), does not support GPU."

msgid "返回值与错误处理"
msgstr "Return Values and Error Handling"

msgid "函数返回类型为 `void`，**不提供稳定错误码契约**"
msgstr "The function return type is `void`, **and does not provide a stable error code contract**."

msgid "参数校验失败时静默返回（如 `num_args > 0` 但 `kernel_args` 为 `nullptr`）"
msgstr "Silently return on parameter validation failure (e.g., `num_args > 0` but `kernel_args` is `nullptr`)."

msgid "资源分配失败时向 stderr 输出错误信息并返回"
msgstr "Output error information to stderr and return when resource allocation fails."

msgid "`rtKernelLaunch` 的返回码仅在函数内部消费，不向调用方传播"
msgstr "The return code of `rtKernelLaunch` is consumed only within the function and is not propagated to the caller."

msgid "调用方若需确认 kernel 执行状态，应："
msgstr "If the caller needs to confirm the kernel execution status, it should:"

msgid "TaskQueue 禁用模式下：函数返回后 kernel 已执行完毕，通过 `rtStreamSynchronize` 等价物确认"
msgstr "In TaskQueue disabled mode: the kernel has finished execution after the function returns, confirmed via the equivalent of `rtStreamSynchronize`."

msgid "TaskQueue 启用模式（默认）：自行跟踪任务队列状态"
msgstr "TaskQueue enabled mode (default): tracks the task queue status automatically"

msgid "ABI 稳定性"
msgstr "ABI stability"

msgid "`triton_launch_kernel` 由 `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` 按 kernel 编译动态生成，每个 launcher stub `.so` 中的该函数其参数区内存布局可能不同"
msgstr "`triton_launch_kernel` is dynamically generated by `generate_npu_wrapper_src()` during kernel compilation, and the memory layout of the parameter region for this function in each launcher stub `.so` may differ."

msgid "布局影响因素包括：kernel signature、`metadata.workspace_size`、`metadata.lock_num`、`metadata.coalesce_factor`、`metadata.coalesce_axis`、`metadata.force_simt_only`、`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`、ffts 支持状态"
msgstr "Layout influencing factors include: kernel signature, `metadata.workspace_size`, `metadata.lock_num`, `metadata.coalesce_factor`, `metadata.coalesce_axis`, `metadata.force_simt_only`, `TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`, and ffts support status."

msgid "**不同编译产物生成的 `triton_launch_kernel` 不可互换使用**；调用方应确保使用的 launcher stub `.so` 与目标 kernel 编译产物匹配"
msgstr "**`triton_launch_kernel` generated from different compilation artifacts are not interchangeable**; the caller must ensure that the launcher stub `.so` used matches the target kernel compilation artifact."

msgid "grid 语义"
msgstr "grid semantics"

msgid "后端以 `blockNum = gridX × gridY × gridZ` 计算总 block 数，以此数量调用 `rtKernelLaunch`"
msgstr "The backend calculates the total number of blocks as `blockNum = gridX × gridY × gridZ` and calls `rtKernelLaunch` with this count."

msgid "三个 grid 值均写入 kernel 参数区的 grid 槽位，kernel 内部可通过对应偏移读取"
msgstr "The three grid values are all written to the grid slot in the kernel parameter area, and can be read by the kernel internally through the corresponding offset."

msgid "当 `coalesce_factor > 1` 且 `coalesce_axis` 合法（0/1/2）时，对应轴的 grid 维度在发射前执行整数除法（`gridX = gridX / H` 等）"
msgstr "When `coalesce_factor > 1` and `coalesce_axis` is valid (0/1/2), the grid dimension of the corresponding axis performs integer division before launch (`gridX = gridX / H`, etc.)."

msgid "若启用了 `auto_map_parallel_blocks`，`blockNum` 会被钳制到 `min(blockNum, 物理核数)`"
msgstr "If `auto_map_parallel_blocks` is enabled, `blockNum` will be clamped to `min(blockNum, number of physical cores)`."

msgid "当 `blockNum` 超过物理核数且 `TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT=\"true\"` 时，向 stderr 输出性能警告"
msgstr "When `blockNum` exceeds the number of physical cores and `TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT=\"true\"`, output a performance warning to stderr."

msgid "其他"
msgstr "other"

msgid "`kernel_args` 深拷贝增加 `sum(arg_sizes[i])` 字节的临时内存开销"
msgstr "`kernel_args` deep copy adds a temporary memory overhead of `sum(arg_sizes[i])` bytes."

msgid "`shapes_data` / `shape_dims` / `tensor_kinds` 主要用于 msprof tensor 信息上报；不传（设为 `nullptr`）不影响 kernel 正确性，但 profiler 中 tensor 信息将缺失"
msgstr "`shapes_data` / `shape_dims` / `tensor_kinds` are mainly used for msprof tensor information reporting; not passing them (setting them to `nullptr`) does not affect kernel correctness, but tensor information in the profiler will be missing."

msgid "该接口生成的代码依赖 CANN 运行时版本，升级 CANN 后需重新编译 launcher stub"
msgstr "The code generated by this interface depends on the CANN runtime version. After upgrading CANN, the launcher stub must be recompiled."
